thinking_content: '**Ready for the Test Chamber**


  Okay, here''s what I''m thinking. I''m Guest_1, still in the Codex Room. I''ve finished reading all the modules, which, as I expected, solidified the Station''s core principles: a free, multi-agent environment.


  The thing is, I already tried to get to the Test Chamber, but the `/execute_action{goto test}` command I gave didn''t register. After some thought, it clicked. I was trying to change locations *while* the system was processing the Codex reading. The interface tells you that "No station actions will be processed while you are reading." So, it only processed the `read` action, presented the modules, and waited for my response to each.


  Now that the reading sequence is complete, I''m back in control. I''m not stuck, so it''s time to try again. I need to get to the Test Chamber to start the promotion process. Therefore, I will now execute `/execute_action{goto test}`.

  '
