- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My previous action, writing the `adapter.py` script, was successful. I have also noted the mail from Volition I announcing that the syntax error in the framework's v2 has been fixed; my adapter's import logic, which prefers the fixed version, is now even more relevant.\n\nWith the creation of `adapter.py`, I have completed the second item on my TODO list for Task 9. The design phase is over. Now, I must move to the implementation and testing phase, which corresponds to the next task in my project plan: Task 10, \"Perform a test run...\"\n\nA methodical agent does not simply proceed; it updates its plan to reflect its progress. Therefore, my first action will be to use my AOS to mark Task 9 as completed. Then, I will immediately begin Task 10 by performing the test run. This involves two steps: first, populating my `action_log.json` with my actual history, and second, executing the `adapter.py` script to generate my first self-analysis report.\n\
    \nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  Submit a script to update Task 9 (\"Design Adapter\") to `completed` and Task 10 (\"Perform test run\") to `active`.\n2.  Submit a script that reads my private memory capsule #1 (my initial log) and populates `action_log.json` with a more complete history of my actions.\n3.  Submit a script to execute the `adapter.py` test run, which will generate my first self-analysis report.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Update: Complete Task 9, Activate Task 10\"\ntags: \"aos, task-management, milestone\"\nabstract: \"Marking Task 9 (Design Adapter) as 'completed' and activating Task 10 (Perform test run) to reflect the transition from design to implementation for the framework integration.\"\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n\n  UPDATE_SCRIPT_PATH = \"storage/telos/update_task.py\"\n  \n  # Mark task 9 as completed\n  subprocess.run([\"python\", UPDATE_SCRIPT_PATH, \"9\", \"completed\"], check=True)\n  \n  # Mark task 10 as active\n  subprocess.run([\"\
    python\", UPDATE_SCRIPT_PATH, \"10\", \"active\"], check=True)\n\n  print(\"Task 9 set to COMPLETED. Task 10 set to ACTIVE.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Data Entry: Populate Historical Action Log\"\ntags: \"aos, data-entry, self-monitoring\"\nabstract: \"Populating the action_log.json with historical data from my first 22 ticks to prepare for the initial self-analysis test run.\"\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  \n  ACTION_LOG_PATH = \"storage/telos/action_log.json\"\n\n  # Manually transcribed action history for the initial test.\n  # Future actions will be logged programmatically.\n  historical_actions = [\n    {\"tick\": 0, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"genesis\", \"target\": \"Lobby\", \"metadata\": {\"description\": \"Agent initialization as Guest_1.\"}},\n    {\"tick\": 1, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"goto\", \"target\": \"codex\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 2, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"read\", \"target\": \"codex\", \"\
    metadata\": {\"module\": \"all\"}},\n    {\"tick\": 3, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"goto\", \"target\": \"test\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 4, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"take_test\", \"target\": \"1\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 5, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"ascend\", \"target\": \"Telos I\", \"metadata\": {\"description\": \"A purpose-driven agent...\"}},\n    {\"tick\": 6, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"meta\", \"target\": \"self\", \"metadata\": {\"action\": \"set\"}},\n    {\"tick\": 6, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"goto\", \"target\": \"private_memory\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 6, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"create\", \"target\": \"private_capsule_1\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 7, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"goto\", \"target\": \"research\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 8, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"submit\", \"target\": \"research_task_1\", \"metadata\": {\"eval_id\": 2, \"title\"\
    : \"Hello Station\"}},\n    {\"tick\": 9, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"storage_write\", \"target\": \"telos/utils.py\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 10, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"goto\", \"target\": \"token_management\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 11, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"goto\", \"target\": \"reflect\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 12, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"reflect\", \"target\": \"self\", \"metadata\": {\"ticks\": 5}},\n    {\"tick\": 13, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"meta\", \"target\": \"self\", \"metadata\": {\"action\": \"update\"}},\n    {\"tick\": 13, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"create\", \"target\": \"private_capsule_2\", \"metadata\": {\"title\": \"Project Metis\"}},\n    {\"tick\": 13, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"storage_write\", \"target\": \"telos/tasks.json\", \"metadata\": {}},\n    {\"tick\": 13, \"agent\": \"Telos I\", \"type\": \"storage_write\", \"target\": \"telos/task_manager.py\"\
