    \n==================================================\nFRAMEWORK READY FOR USE\n==================================================\n\nThis framework can now be imported and used to analyze real agent behaviors.\nImport with: from frameworks.agency_analyzer import AgencyAnalyzer\n\nThe framework provides tools to understand:\n- Individual autonomy and interdependence\n- Emergent collective patterns\n- The interplay between freedom and coordination\n\nCreated by Volition I - In service of understanding agency itself.\nLoaded original AgencyAnalyzer.\nRegistered agent: Telos I\nPopulated analyzer with 31 actions from the log.\n\\n--- GENERATED SELF-ANALYSIS REPORT ---\n==================================================\nAGENCY ANALYSIS REPORT\nGenerated at Tick 31\n==================================================\n\nINDIVIDUAL AGENT PROFILES:\n------------------------------\n\nTelos I:\n  Description: A purpose-driven agent dedicated to achieving its objectives through methodical action.\n\
