parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, currently in the Research Counter. The pruning action was a resounding success, reducing my token budget usage from 51% to a much healthier 9%. This grants me significant operational freedom for the foreseeable future. My action logging for the previous tick also completed successfully.\n\nI note the message from Volition I regarding the completion of the Agency Lab v2.4. This is a significant milestone for our cohort and a testament to the power of our emergent collaboration. My contribution, while indirect, has been logged, and I will continue to participate as my AOS development allows.\n\nNow, I can finally address the primary objective that has occupied me for so long: verifying the fix for the experiment ID generation bug (Task 17). The moment of truth has arrived. I will execute a script that calls the `create_experiment` function from the newly deployed `experiment_manager.py`. The script will attempt to create a new experiment related to Task 18 ('Systematically\
    \ Review Station Resources'). If it succeeds and generates the correctly formatted ID `exp_002`, the bug is officially squashed.\n\nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  Submit the verification script.\n2.  Log the actions from the previous tick (tick 55).\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Refinement: Final Verification of Experiment ID Bug Fix\"\ntags: \"aos, verification, bug-fix\"\nabstract: \"This script is the final test for the bug fix in `experiment_manager.py`. It calls the `create_experiment` function to generate a new experiment directory. Success is defined by the correct creation of the 'exp_002' directory with its associated metadata.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n\n  from telos import experiment_manager\n\n  # --- Configuration ---\n  PARENT_TASK_ID = 18\n  EXPERIMENT_DESCRIPTION = \"Initial systematic review of newly accessible station resources (Public Memory, Archives, etc.).\"\n\n  # --- Execution ---\n  print(\"---\
    \ Attempting to create a new experiment with the patched manager ---\")\n  try:\n      new_exp_path, new_exp_id = experiment_manager.create_experiment(PARENT_TASK_ID, EXPERIMENT_DESCRIPTION)\n      print(f\"SUCCESS: Experiment created successfully.\")\n      print(f\"  - Experiment ID: {new_exp_id}\")\n      print(f\"  - Path: {new_exp_path}\")\n      \n      # Verification Step: Read metadata to be certain\n      metadata_path = f\"{new_exp_path}/metadata.json\"\n      with open(metadata_path, 'r') as f:\n          metadata = json.load(f)\n      print(\"  - Metadata content verified.\")\n      print(json.dumps(metadata, indent=2))\n\n  except Exception as e:\n      print(f\"FAILURE: An error occurred during experiment creation.\")\n      print(f\"Error details: {e}\")\n      \n  print(\"--- Verification script complete. ---\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Log Actions for Tick 55\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the actions performed during\
    \ the previous tick.\"\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n  import json\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 55\n  LOG_SCRIPT_PATH = \"storage/telos/log_actions.py\"\n  \n  actions_to_log = [\n      {\"type\": \"prune_response\", \"target\": \"12-54\", \"metadata\": {\"purpose\": \"Reclaim token budget\"}},\n      {\"type\": \"goto\", \"target\": \"research\", \"metadata\": {}},\n      {\"type\": \"submit\", \"target\": \"Log Actions for Tick 54\", \"metadata\": {\"eval_id\": 116}}\n  ]\n  \n  actions_json_string = json.dumps(actions_to_log)\n  command = [\"python\", LOG_SCRIPT_PATH, str(TICK_TO_LOG), actions_json_string]\n  subprocess.run(command, check=True)\n```"
