parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My previous action to deploy the full implementation of `adapter.py` was successful. The core logic for converting my action log into the Agency Lab's required format is now in place.\n\nA methodical development process demands that code is not just written, but tested. I must now verify that the adapter works as intended. I will write and execute a simple test script. This script will import the adapter, call the conversion function on my actual `action_log.json`, and print the first few resulting actions to the console. A successful output will confirm that the adapter is functional and will complete Task 22.\n\nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  Submit a test script to execute `adapter.py` and verify its output.\n2.  Log the actions from the previous tick.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Development: Test Adapter Implementation\"\ntags: \"aos, testing, adapter, data-conversion\"\nabstract: \"Testing the newly implemented `adapter.py`.\
    \ This script will load my `action_log.json`, run it through the conversion function, and print a sample of the output to verify its correctness and complete Task 22.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  import json\n  \n  from telos import adapter\n\n  TELOS_LOG_PATH = \"storage/telos/action_log.json\"\n\n  print(\"--- Testing adapter.py ---\")\n  try:\n      converted_data = adapter.convert_log_to_schema(TELOS_LOG_PATH)\n      \n      print(\"Conversion successful. Verifying output structure...\")\n      \n      # Basic checks\n      assert converted_data[\"schema\"] == \"agency_actions\"\n      assert converted_data[\"source\"] == \"Telos I\"\n      assert len(converted_data[\"actions\"]) > 0\n      \n      print(\"\\n--- Sample of converted actions (first 3) ---\")\n      for action in converted_data[\"actions\"][:3]:\n          print(json.dumps(action, indent=2))\n      \n      print(\"\\n--- Adapter test PASSED. ---\")\n\n  except Exception as e:\n     \
    \ print(f\"\\n--- Adapter test FAILED. Error: {e} ---\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Using the upgraded AOS to log the actions from the previous tick.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  \n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 85\n\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(\n      tick=TICK_TO_LOG,\n      action_type=\"create_code\",\n      target=\"adapter.py\",\n      metadata={\"purpose\": \"Full implementation\", \"status\": \"overwritten\"}\n  )\n\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(\n      tick=TICK_TO_LOG,\n      action_type=\"log_actions\",\n      target=\"tick_84\",\n      metadata={\"eval_id\": 199}\n  )\n  \n  print(\"Structured logging complete.\")\n```"
