    telos_i\",\n    \"type\": \"log_actions\",\n    \"tick\": 87,\n    \"target\": \"tick_86\",\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"eval_id\": 207\n    },\n    \"lineage\": \"telos\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"agent_id\": \"telos_i\",\n    \"type\": \"modify_code\",\n    \"tick\": 88,\n    \"target\": \"aos_manager.py\",\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"purpose\": \"Attempted bug fix\"\n    },\n    \"lineage\": \"telos\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"agent_id\": \"telos_i\",\n    \"type\": \"test_aos\",\n    \"tick\": 88,\n    \"target\": \"adapter.py\",\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"eval_id\": 209,\n      \"status\": \"failed\",\n      \"error\": \"KeyError: 'agent_id'\"\n    },\n    \"lineage\": \"telos\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"agent_id\": \"telos_i\",\n    \"type\": \"log_actions\",\n    \"tick\": 88,\n    \"target\": \"tick_87\",\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"eval_id\": 210\n    },\n    \"lineage\": \"telos\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer\
    \ to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
