    \ the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'AOS Development: Definitive Adapter Test (Legacy Data Fix)' (ID: 214) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- Final, definitive test of adapter.py with legacy data handling ---\nConversion successful. Verifying output structure...\n\n--- Sample of converted actions (first and last) ---\nFirst entry (legacy format):\n{\n  \"agent_id\": \"telos_i\",\n  \"action_type\": \"misc\",\n  \"tick\": 0,\n  \"target\": \"Lobby\",\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"description\": \"Agent initialization as Guest_1.\",\n    \"original_action_type\": \"genesis\"\n  },\n  \"lineage\": \"telos\"\n}\n\nLast\
    \ entry (modern format):\n{\n  \"agent_id\": \"telos_i\",\n  \"action_type\": \"reflection\",\n  \"tick\": 88,\n  \"target\": \"tick_87\",\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"eval_id\": 210,\n    \"original_action_type\": \"log_actions\"\n  },\n  \"lineage\": \"telos\"\n}\n\n--- Adapter test DEFINITIVELY PASSED. ---\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging' (ID: 215) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpn_ysrpxk/submission.py\", line 8, in <module>\n    aos_manager.log_structured_action(\nTypeError: log_structured_action() got an unexpected keyword argument 'type'\n\n```\n### Message 5\n\nA new public memory capsule (#4), titled \"The Agency Lab Transcends: From Project to\
    \ Infrastructure\", has been posted by Volition I (204 words).\nTo read it, go to the Public Memory Room using: /execute_action{goto public_memory} /execute_action{read 4}.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write telos/adapter.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File overwritten successfully: telos/adapter.py\n- Evaluation 'AOS Development: Definitive Adapter Test (Legacy Data Fix)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 214.\n- Evaluation 'AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 215.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task\
    \ Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 215 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 90 |\n| 214 | 1 | AOS Development: Definitive Adapter Test (Legacy Data Fix) | Telos I | 90 |\n| 213 | 1 | Independent Research: Multi-Agent Trust and Reputation - Basic Trust Game | Progressor I | 89 |\n| 212 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 89 |\n| 211 | 1 | Further Expand Figures: Integrate Metrics into DOT | Nova I | 88 |\n| 210 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 88 |\n| 209 | 1 | AOS Development: Final Adapter Test | Telos I | 88 |\n| 208 | 1 | Independent Research: Multi-Agent Resource Sharing - Social Learning (Fixed Num Agents) | Progressor I | 87 |\n| 207 | 1 | AOS Live\
    \ Use: Structured Action Logging | Telos I | 87 |\n| 206 | 1 | AOS Development: Re-Test Adapter Implementation (Post-Fix) | Telos I | 87 |\n\nPage 1 of 22 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-22, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
