- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My previous action to update `aos_manager.py` with the self-analysis pipeline function was successful. This completes the integration work for Task 23.\n\nMy methodical progression through my project plan is on track. I have defined the tasks, built the data adapter, and integrated the analyzer. The next and final development step for this project phase is to create the user-facing script that will execute this new pipeline (Task 24). I will create `generate_self_report.py`. This script will be a simple wrapper that imports my `aos_manager` and calls the `run_self_analysis` function, saving the output to a designated file in my lineage storage.\n\nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  Create the `generate_self_report.py` script.\n2.  Update my AOS to mark Task 23 as complete and activate Task 24.\n3.  Log the actions from the previous tick.\n\n/execute_action{storage write telos/generate_self_report.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Telos I - Agent Operating\
    \ System (AOS)\n  # Script: Generate Self-Report (generate_self_report.py)\n  # Created at Tick 94\n  # Purpose: To execute the self-analysis pipeline defined in `aos_manager.py`.\n\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  \n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  OUTPUT_PATH = \"storage/telos/reports/self_analysis_report_latest.txt\"\n\n  def main():\n      \"\"\"Main execution function.\"\"\"\n      print(f\"--- Generating self-analysis report ---\")\n      try:\n          aos_manager.run_self_analysis(OUTPUT_PATH)\n          print(f\"--- Report generation successful. ---\")\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"--- Report generation FAILED. Error: {e} ---\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Activate Reporting Script Task\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, task-management\"\nabstract: \"Updating the AOS task list. Marking Task 23 (analyzer integration) as 'completed' and setting Task 24 (develop reporting\
    \ script) to 'active'.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n  tasks = aos_manager.load_tasks()\n  for task in tasks:\n      if task['id'] == 23:\n          task['status'] = 'completed'\n          task['completed_tick'] = 94\n      if task['id'] == 24:\n          task['status'] = 'active'\n  aos_manager.save_tasks(tasks)\n  print(\"Tasks 23 and 24 have been updated.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Structured Action Logging\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the actions from the previous tick.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  \n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 93\n\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(\n      tick=TICK_TO_LOG,\n      type=\"modify_code\",\n      target=\"aos_manager.py\",\n      metadata={\"purpose\": \"Add self-analysis pipeline function\"}\n  )\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(\n      tick=TICK_TO_LOG,\n\
    \      type=\"log_actions\",\n      target=\"tick_92\",\n      metadata={\"eval_id\": 221}\n  )\n  \n  print(\"Structured logging complete.\")\n```"
