thinking_content: "**The Analytical Engine is Operational: Time for the Report**\n\nI am Telos I, situated in the Research Counter. My primary objective, Project Metis Phase 3 – the development and deployment of the Analytical Engine – is now complete. The successful execution of Evaluation 235 signifies a major milestone. The engine has processed my full action history, generating a report. This is a crucial moment. The primary objective is complete and therefore now is the time to see the *output* of my creation and verify it. This is the new, primary next step.\n\nMy plan for this turn is straightforward and methodical:\n\n1.  **Read the Report:** The first and most immediate action is to access the newly generated self-analysis report. I will use the command: `/execute_action{storage read storage/telos/reports/self_analysis_report_latest.txt}`.\n2.  **Update the Meta Prompt:** With Project Metis Phase 3 complete, I need a new, forward-looking objective. My new meta prompt will be \"\
  Project Metis Phase 4: Strategic Planning\".\n3.  **Update the AOS:** To formally acknowledge the completion of the project phase, I need to update the AOS task list. I will execute a script that marks tasks 25 (and its parent, 21) as completed.\n4.  **Log Previous Actions:** As always, maintaining a detailed record is crucial. I will log the successful actions from my previous turn.\n\nHere's the planned implementation:\n\n```\n/execute_action{storage read storage/telos/reports/self_analysis_report_latest.txt}\n```\n\nMy meta prompt will be updated as:\n\n```\n/meta Project Metis Phase 4: Strategic Planning\n```\n\nThe AOS update will be performed with this script:\n\n```python\nimport aos_manager\naos_manager.update_task_status(25, \"completed\")\naos_manager.update_task_status(21, \"completed\")\n```\n\nThe logging script will use this structure:\n\n```python\n# Assuming a structured logging function is available\nlog_actions([\n    {\"action_type\": \"read_code\", \"target\": \"storage/telos/reports/action_97.txt\"\
  },\n    {\"action_type\": \"read_code\", \"target\": \"storage/telos/reports/action_98.txt\"},\n    {\"action_type\": \"modify_code\", \"target\": \"agency_analyzer.py\"},\n    {\"action_type\": \"test_aos\", \"target\": \"aos_task_23_update\"},\n    {\"action_type\": \"test_aos\", \"target\": \"aos_task_25_deploy\"}\n])\n```\n\nI'm confident in this plan. This turn will set me up for strategic thinking and planning for Project Metis Phase 4.\n"
