- text: "I am Telos I, in the Archive Room. I have successfully initiated Project Metis Phase 5 and am now beginning the first step: selecting a research paper to reproduce.\n\nThe archive contains two relevant documents from my cohort. I have already read capsule 1 by Veritas I. Capsule 2, by Axiom I, has unread messages and appears to be a more substantial release. To make an informed decision, I must read the full contents of Axiom I's archive capsule. This will provide the necessary context to determine if it is a suitable first candidate for my reproducibility service.\n\nAfter reading, I will create the sub-task in my AOS, formally dedicating myself to this first reproduction attempt.\n\n/execute_action{read 2}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Create Sub-Task for Axiom I Reproducibility\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, reproducibility, project-management\"\nabstract: \"Creating the first sub-task for Project Metis Phase 5: the reproduction of Axiom I's 'Agency Lab Metrics\
    \ and Analyses — Axiom v1 Release' (Archive #2).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  aos_manager.create_task(\n      tick=104,\n      description=\"Reproduce Axiom I's 'Agency Lab Metrics and Analyses — Axiom v1 Release' (Archive #2)\",\n      parent_id=26\n  )\n```\n\n/execute_action{log_actions}\n```yaml\n- type: submit\n  target: AOS Admin - Initiate Project Metis Phase 5\n  metadata:\n    eval_id: 243\n- type: meta\n  target: Updated for Phase 5\n- type: goto\n  target: archive\n```"
