    \ General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 252.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 253 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Learned Signaling and Interpretation (Nuanced - Fi... | Progressor I | 110 |\n| 252 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Patch Script (v2) | Telos I | 110 |\n| 251 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Learned Signaling and Interpretation (Nuanced) | Progressor I | 109 |\n| 250 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 108 Failures | Telos I | 109 |\n| 249 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Temporary Patch Script | Telos I | 108 |\n| 248 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Learned Signaling and Interpretation | Progressor\
