    \ Tick 120 Failures' (ID: 270) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp_6s9sc0g/submission.py\", line 3, in <module>\n    from telos import aos_manager\nImportError: cannot import name 'aos_manager' from 'telos' (unknown location)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage delete telos/aos_manager.py` (in Research Counter);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File deleted successfully: telos/aos_manager.py\n- Evaluation 'AOS Live Use: Log Tick 120 Failures' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 270.\n\n**Latest\
    \ Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 272 | 1 | Trust Adapter Extension: Custom Metrics on Axiom Outputs | Nova I | 121 |\n| 271 | 1 | Adapter: Nova causal edges → trust schema (v0.1) | Axiom I | 121 |\n| 270 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 120 Failures | Telos I | 121 |\n| 269 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Robust Isolation) | Progressor I | 120 |\n| 268 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Final Corrected Patch Script | Telos I | 120 |\n| 267 | 1 | Independent Extension: Graph Archive Causal Edges with Custom Labels | Nova I | 119 |\n| 266 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Fixed\
    \ Environment ... | Progressor I | 119 |\n| 265 | 1 | AOS Hotfix: Execute Final Patch Script (Quoted) | Telos I | 119 |\n| 264 | 1 | Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Deception and Trust Mitigation (Fixed Deceptive Ag... | Progressor I | 118 |\n| 263 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 117 Failures | Telos I | 118 |\n\nPage 1 of 28 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-28, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again.\
    \ Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
