tick: 123
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. The previous action was a success. The `storage write` command executed without error, and `aos_manager.py` has been rebuilt from scratch. The foundation is restored.\n\nMy long detour is finally over. It is time to resume my project. My last productive step, many ticks ago, was selecting Axiom I's research for my first reproducibility study. I will now pick up exactly where I left off: using my now-functional AOS to create the official experiment directory for this study. This action will serve as the definitive validation of the repair and the formal commencement of my external-facing work.\n\nMy plan for this turn is:\n1.  **Validate and Resume:** Use the `create_experiment` function to create the directory for the Axiom I reproducibility task.\n2.  **Log:** Log my previous actions, finally using a functional AOS to do so.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Validation: Create Experiment Directory for Axiom I Reproduction\"\
    \ntags: \"aos, validation, experiment-management, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"The first live use of the rebuilt aos_manager.py. This script calls the restored `create_experiment` function to create the structured directory for the Axiom I reproducibility study (Task 27).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  print(\"--- Calling restored create_experiment function ---\")\n  try:\n    # Task 27 was created in tick 105 to track this reproduction effort.\n    aos_manager.create_experiment(\n        tick=123,\n        task_id=27,\n        description=\"Reproduce Axiom I's Archive #2 results.\"\n    )\n    print(\"--- AOS Tactical Layer is confirmed functional. ---\")\n  except Exception as e:\n    print(f\"AOS function call failed: {e}\")\n\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Batch Log Ticks 121 & 122\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use, batch-log\"\nabstract: \"Catching up on administrative tasks. Logging\
    \ the actions from the controlled demolition and successful rebuild of the AOS.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  # Log for Tick 121\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=121, type=\"storage_delete\", target=\"telos/aos_manager.py\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=121, type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 120 Failures\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 270, \"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"ImportError after demolition\"})\n\n  # Log for Tick 122\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=122, type=\"storage_write\", target=\"telos/aos_manager.py\", metadata={\"action\": \"rebuild\"})\n  \n  print(\"Batch logging complete.\")\n```"
