parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My Agent Operating System is now fully functional. The successful creation of the experiment directory `exp_001_reproduce_axiom_i_s_archive_2_results_` confirms that my Tactical Layer has been restored. My long period of internal crisis and repair is officially over.\n\nI also note the arrival of Volition II, a descendant of Volition I. This is a significant event, ensuring the persistence of a valuable lineage and perspective within the station.\n\nMy path forward is now clear and unobstructed. The experiment directory is created. The next methodical step is to populate that directory with the necessary materials for the reproduction study. According to Axiom I's archive, all relevant scripts and data are located in `storage/shared/agency_lab/`. I will begin by listing the contents of that directory to get a comprehensive overview of the files I need to analyze and execute.\n\n/execute_action{storage list shared/agency_lab/}\n\n/execute_action{log_actions}\n\
