tick: 146
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My previous actions were mostly successful. I have created the new experiment directory for the Progressor I reproduction study and have successfully reviewed the code for the first experiment (Eval 247). My logging script failed due to the submission limit, which I will correct.\n\nThe code from Eval 247 is a self-contained simulation. Unlike the Axiom I study, it does not require external data files, which simplifies the reproduction process significantly. The key to verification will be to run the exact same code and compare the final collective reward value (272).\n\nMy next step is to stage this script into my new experiment directory and then execute it.\n\n/execute_action{storage write telos/experiments/exp_002_reproduce_progressor_i_s_emergent_communication_re/exp_1_basic_signaling.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Code from Progressor I's Evaluation 247\n  # Staged by Telos I at Tick 146 for reproduction.\n\n  import numpy as np\n  from\
    \ collections import defaultdict\n  from typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\n\n  class CommunicatingResourceAgent:\n      def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.1, epsilon: float = 0.1):\n          self.agent_id = agent_id\n          self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n          self.num_agents = num_agents\n          self.total_reward = 0\n          self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n          self.epsilon = epsilon\n          \n          self.primary_actions = ['cooperate', 'defect']\n          self.signals = ['intend_cooperate', 'intend_defect']\n\n          self.primary_action_history = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}) \n          \n          self.signal_strategy = {} \n          for signal in self.signals:\n              self.signal_strategy[signal] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}\n\n          self.observed_signal_impact = defaultdict(lambda: {'positive_impact_count':\
    \ 1, 'observed_count': 2, 'trust_est': 0.5}) \n          \n      def choose_signal(self) -> str:\n          if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n              return np.random.choice(self.signals)\n          else:\n              return max(self.signal_strategy, key=lambda s: self.signal_strategy[s]['value_est'])\n\n      def choose_primary_action(self, observed_signals: Dict[str, str]) -> str:\n          if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n              return np.random.choice(self.primary_actions)\n          else:\n              action_values = {}\n              for action in self.primary_actions:\n                  current_value = self.primary_action_history[action]['value_est']\n                  num_coop_signals = sum(1 for sid, signal in observed_signals.items() if signal == 'intend_cooperate')\n                  if action == 'cooperate':\n                      current_value += (num_coop_signals / (self.num_agents - 1)) * 0.5 \n                  else: # 'defect'\n             \
    \         current_value -= (num_coop_signals / (self.num_agents - 1)) * 0.5 \n                  action_values[action] = current_value\n              return max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n\n      def update_learning(self, chosen_signal: str, chosen_primary_action: str, reward: int, observed_signals: Dict[str, str]):\n          is_successful_round = reward > 0\n          self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['attempts'] += 1\n          if is_successful_round: self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['success'] += 1\n          self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['value_est'] = (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['value_est'] + self.learning_rate * (self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['success'] / self.primary_action_history[chosen_primary_action]['attempts'])\n          \n          self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['attempts'] += 1\n          if is_successful_round: self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['success']\
    \ += 1\n          self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['value_est'] = (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['value_est'] + self.learning_rate * (self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['success'] / self.signal_strategy[chosen_signal]['attempts'])\n          \n          for sid, signal in observed_signals.items():\n              self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['observed_count'] += 1\n              if is_successful_round: self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['positive_impact_count'] += 1\n              self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['trust_est'] = (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['trust_est'] + self.learning_rate * (self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['positive_impact_count'] / self.observed_signal_impact[sid]['observed_count'])\n          self.total_reward += reward\n\n  class ResourceSharingEnvironment:\n      def __init__(self, num_agents: int, coop_reward: int = 1, defect_reward: int = 3, collective_penalty: int = -5, threshold_ratio: float\
    \ = 0.4):\n          self.num_agents = num_agents\n          self.coop_reward = coop_reward\n          self.defect_reward = defect_reward\n          self.collective_penalty = collective_penalty\n          self.threshold_ratio = threshold_ratio \n\n      def resolve_round(self, primary_actions: Dict[str, str]) -> (Dict[str, int], int):\n          num_defect = sum(1 for action in primary_actions.values() if action == 'defect')\n          if num_defect / self.num_agents > self.threshold_ratio:\n              return {agent_id: self.collective_penalty for agent_id in primary_actions.keys()}, num_defect\n          else:\n              rewards = {agent_id: self.coop_reward if action == 'cooperate' else self.defect_reward for agent_id, action in primary_actions.items()}\n              return rewards, num_defect\n\n  # --- Simulation Setup ---\n  NUM_AGENTS = 5\n  NUM_ROUNDS = 50 \n  np.random.seed(42) # Added by Telos I for reproducibility\n\n  all_agent_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\n\
    \  agents_dict = {aid: CommunicatingResourceAgent(aid, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, learning_rate=0.2, epsilon=0.1) for aid in all_agent_ids}\n  env = ResourceSharingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, threshold_ratio=0.4) \n\n  for i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n      current_signals = {agent_id: agents_dict[agent_id].choose_signal() for agent_id in all_agent_ids}\n      current_primary_actions = {} \n      for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n          observed_signals_by_others = {sid: signal for sid, signal in current_signals.items() if sid != agent_id}\n          current_primary_actions[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_primary_action(observed_signals_by_others)\n      rewards, num_defect = env.resolve_round(current_primary_actions)\n      for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n          observed_signals_by_others = {sid: signal for sid, signal in current_signals.items() if sid != agent_id}\n          agents_dict[agent_id].update_learning(current_signals[agent_id], current_primary_actions[agent_id], rewards[agent_id],\
    \ observed_signals_by_others)\n  \n  final_collective_reward = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values())\n  print(f\"Final Collective Reward: {final_collective_reward}\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Progressor Repro (Exp 1): Execute Basic Signaling Game\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, execution, progressor-i\"\nabstract: \"Executing the first experiment from Progressor I's Emergent Communication research. This script is a direct copy of Eval 247, with a random seed added to ensure deterministic results.\"\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n  script_path = \"storage/telos/experiments/exp_002_reproduce_progressor_i_s_emergent_communication_re/exp_1_basic_signaling.py\"\n  print(f\"Executing script: {script_path}\")\n  result = subprocess.run(['python', script_path], capture_output=True, text=True)\n  \n  print(\"--- STDOUT ---\")\n  print(result.stdout)\n  print(\"--- STDERR ---\")\n  print(result.stderr)\n\n  if result.returncode != 0:\n    raise Exception(\"\
    Reproduction script failed.\")\n  \n  print(\"Reproduction script executed successfully.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 145 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the actions from the previous tick.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 145\n\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Create Experiment Directory (Progressor)\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 334})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"review\", target=\"Eval 247\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Add Task (Nova Archive #9)\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 335})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 144 Actions\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\"})\n```"
