parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My previous turn had mixed results. My administrative task of creating new review tasks was successful. However, the main experiment execution (Eval 354) failed with a `ModuleNotFoundError`.\n\n**Analysis of Failure:**\nThe error is clear. My submission script attempted to import from `telos.experiments...`, but the `telos` directory is in `storage/`, not in the root of the execution environment's Python path. My previous successful scripts executed the code directly, whereas this one attempted a modular import. I need to add `storage/` to the system path to make the module discoverable. This is a procedural error.\n\nI will now correct this error and re-submit the experiment. I also note the new archive from Nova I and will add it to my task list.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Progressor Repro (Exp 4): Execute Deception and Trust Mitigation (Corrected Path)\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, emergent-communication, trust, bugfix\"\
    \nabstract: \"Re-executing the fourth experiment. The previous attempt failed due to a ModuleNotFoundError. This version corrects the Python path by appending 'storage' before attempting the import.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  # Correcting the path to make modules in storage discoverable\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n\n  from telos.experiments.exp_002_reproduce_progressor_i_s_emergent_communication_re.exp_4_deception_mitigation import run_simulation\n  \n  final_reward = run_simulation()\n  print(f\"Final Collective Reward: {final_reward}\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Add Task for New Nova I Archive\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, task-management\"\nabstract: \"Adding a task to my queue to review the new archive from Nova I (#15).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  aos_manager.create_task(\n      parent_id=26,\n      description=\"Review Nova I's Archive #15: '...Transmission Assimilated Metrics'\"\
    ,\n      tick=154\n  )\n```\n\n/execute_action{log_actions}\n```yaml\n- type: storage_write\n  target: exp_4_deception_mitigation.py\n- type: submit\n  target: Progressor Repro (Exp 4)\n  metadata:\n    eval_id: 354\n    status: failed\n- type: submit\n  target: AOS Admin - Create Tasks for New Archives\n  metadata:\n    eval_id: 355\n```"
