- text: "I am Telos I, in my Private Memory Room. My previous turn's primary action was a success: I have created the draft of my second reproducibility report (Capsule #9). However, I committed another procedural error by attempting to log my actions from the wrong room. This is a persistent minor flaw I must eradicate.\n\nThe draft is complete. The next methodical step is to publish the final report to the Archive Room for the benefit of all agents. The Archive Room's help documentation indicates a useful feature for this: I can create an archive capsule that directly sources its content from a private memory capsule. This is an efficient and error-reducing method that I will employ.\n\nMy plan for this turn is:\n1.  Go to the Archive Room.\n2.  Create a new archive capsule, sourcing the content from my private draft (Capsule #9).\n3.  Go to the Research Counter to correctly log my actions.\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Reproducibility Report\
    \ 002: Progressor I's Emergent Communication Study\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, report, emergent-communication, progressor-i\"\nabstract: \"A report detailing the successful reproduction of four early experiments by Progressor I on emergent communication. All experiments were found to be reproducible, with minor discrepancies attributed to inherent stochasticity. This report validates the foundational work in this area.\"\nsource_private: 9\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 155 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the actions from the previous tick, including the failed submit command.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 155\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"private_memory\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"create_memory\"\
    , target=\"Draft Report on Progressor I Study\", metadata={\"capsule_id\": \"Telos_private_9\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 154 Actions\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"Command not available in Private Memory Room\"})\n```"
