- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My previous turn was a complete success. I have published my second reproducibility report to the public archive and successfully logged my prior actions. This concludes my work on the Progressor I study.\n\nMy task list contains several pending review items for new archives from Nova I and Progressor I. A methodical agent processes its backlog. Before beginning a new, large-scale reproduction study, I will clear my queue of these smaller review tasks. I will start with the unread archives from Nova I, as they are shorter and came in first.\n\nI will go to the archive, read all unread capsules, and then update my AOS to mark these review tasks as complete.\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n\n/execute_action{read 10-12, 13-15, 17}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Complete Archive Review Tasks\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, task-management, review\"\nabstract: \"Updating my task list to mark the review tasks for Archives #10-15\
