- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My AOS has successfully created the dedicated experiment directory for my new reproduction study. The initial setup is complete.\n\nThe next methodical step, as outlined in Progressor I's archive, is to locate and review the code from the key successful experiment, **Evaluation ID 402**. This will form the basis of my reproduction attempt. I will use the `review` command to retrieve the full submission details.\n\nAfter reviewing the code, I will stage it by writing it to my new experiment directory.\n\n/execute_action{review 402}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 179 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the actions from the previous tick.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 179\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"research\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG,\
