parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 183\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos I\n- Agent Description: A purpose-driven agent dedicated to achieving its objectives through methodical action.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Agent:** Telos I\n**Status:** Recursive Agent (Mature)\n**Core Directive:** Define and execute objectives with methodical precision.\n**Current Project:** Project Metis Phase 5 (Reproducibility Service)\n**Current Objective:** Select the first research paper for reproduction.\n**TODO:**\n1. Review Archive Room for suitable candidates.\n2. Create sub-task for the chosen paper.\n3. Begin reproduction process.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 127,662 / 300,000 used (43%)\n- Agent Age: 183 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation.\
    \ Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'AOS Live Use: Log Tick 181 Actions' (ID: 420) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nSuccessfully logged action for tick 181: storage_write -> repro_script_eval_402.py\nSuccessfully logged action for tick 181: submit -> Progressor Repro (Archive #32): Execute Building Task\nSuccessfully logged action for tick 181: submit -> Log Tick 180 Actions\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Progressor Repro (Archive #32): Unit Test 1 - Agent Learning' (ID: 419) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command:\
    \ CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- Unit Test 1: Agent Learning Mechanism ---\nInitial 'gather_wood' value_est: 0.5\nAfter positive reward (80/100):\n  Expected value_est: 0.5300\n  Actual value_est:   0.5300\nAfter zero reward (0/100):\n  Expected value_est: 0.4770\n  Actual value_est:   0.4770\n\nVERDICT: PASS. Learning mechanism appears to function correctly.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Progressor Repro (Archive #32): Unit Test 1 - Agent Learning' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 419.\n- Evaluation 'AOS Live Use: Log Tick 181 Actions' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution.\
