parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My execution of the corrected script (v3) has completed. However, the `STDOUT` is empty. This is unexpected. The original script and my previous failed run both produced a final reward score. The absence of output indicates a new problem.\n\n**Analysis of Failure:**\nMy previous `storage write` action was flawed. In my haste to be concise in the response, I did not paste the full Python script. The comment `# [The rest of the full script, including the main simulation loop]` was a placeholder for my internal process, but it meant the file written to storage was incomplete. It defined the classes but never instantiated them or ran the simulation loop. Thus, the script ran, did nothing, and exited successfully with no output. This is another failure of procedural rigor.\n\n**Path Forward:**\nI must repeat the `storage write` command one last time, this time with the *actual*, complete, and corrected code. There can be no more shortcuts or placeholders.\n\
    \n/execute_action{storage write telos/experiments/exp_001_reproduction_of_progressor_i_s_complex_cooperative/repro_script_eval_402_corrected_v4.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  from collections import defaultdict\n  from typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\n  import math\n  import random\n  \n  random.seed(123)\n  np.random.seed(123)\n\n  # --- Resources and Components ---\n  RESOURCES = {\"wood\": {\"cost\": 1}, \"stone\": {\"cost\": 2}, \"metal\": {\"cost\": 3}}\n  COMPONENTS = {\"foundation\": {\"resources\": {\"stone\": 2, \"wood\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 2}, \"wall_segment\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 2, \"metal\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 3}, \"roof_panel\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 3}, \"craft_time\": 1}}\n  BUILDING_PLAN = {\"house\": [(\"foundation_1\", []), (\"foundation_2\", []), (\"wall_segment_1\", [\"foundation_1\"]), (\"wall_segment_2\", [\"foundation_2\"]), (\"roof_panel_1\", [\"wall_segment_1\", \"wall_segment_2\"])]}\n\n  class Resource:\n      def __init__(self,\
    \ resource_id: str, amount: int):\n          self.id = resource_id\n          self.amount = amount\n\n  class Component:\n      def __init__(self, component_id: str, blueprint: Dict[str, Any]):\n          self.id = component_id\n          self.resources_needed = blueprint[\"resources\"].copy()\n          self.craft_time = blueprint[\"craft_time\"]\n          self.current_craft_time = 0\n          self.ready_for_assembly = False\n      def add_craft_time(self, amount: int):\n          if not self.ready_for_assembly:\n              self.current_craft_time += amount\n              if self.current_craft_time >= self.craft_time:\n                  self.ready_for_assembly = True\n\n  class BuildingComponent:\n      def __init__(self, component_id: str, dependencies: List[str]):\n          self.id = component_id\n          self.dependencies = dependencies\n          self.crafted_ready = False \n          self.assembled = False\n      def check_crafted_ready(self, world_components: Dict[str,\
    \ Component]):\n          base_comp_id = '_'.join(self.id.split('_')[:-1])\n          if base_comp_id in world_components and world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\n              self.crafted_ready = True\n      def check_dependencies(self, building_status: Dict[str, 'BuildingComponent']) -> bool:\n          return all(building_status[dep].assembled for dep in self.dependencies)\n      def assemble(self):\n          if self.crafted_ready and not self.assembled:\n              self.assembled = True\n\n  class ConstructionAgent:\n      def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.1, epsilon_start: float = 0.08, epsilon_end: float = 0.02, mutation_rate: float = 0.05, preferred_action: str = None):\n          self.agent_id = agent_id\n          self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n          self.num_agents = num_agents\n          self.total_reward = 0\n          self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n          self.epsilon_start\
    \ = epsilon_start\n          self.epsilon_end = epsilon_end\n          self.mutation_rate = mutation_rate\n          self.preferred_action = preferred_action\n          self.action_strategy = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5})\n          if self.preferred_action: self.action_strategy[self.preferred_action]['value_est'] = 0.9\n          self.reputations = {aid: 0.5 for aid in all_agent_ids if aid != agent_id}\n          self.action_history_window = 20\n          self.recent_actions = defaultdict(lambda: [])\n          self.specialization_index = 0.0\n          self.most_specialized_action = \"None\"\n          self.current_resources = {res_id: 0 for res_id in RESOURCES.keys()}\n      def _get_epsilon(self, current_round: int, total_rounds: int) -> float:\n          decay_rate = (self.epsilon_start - self.epsilon_end) / total_rounds\n          return max(self.epsilon_end, self.epsilon_start - decay_rate * current_round)\n      def choose_action(self, available_tasks:\
    \ List[str], current_round: int, total_rounds: int, env_world_components: Dict[str, Component], env_building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent]) -> Tuple[str, str]:\n          current_epsilon = self._get_epsilon(current_round, total_rounds)\n          if np.random.rand() < current_epsilon:\n              action_type = np.random.choice([\"gather\", \"craft\", \"assemble\"])\n              if action_type == \"gather\": target_id = np.random.choice(list(RESOURCES.keys()))\n              elif action_type == \"craft\": target_id = np.random.choice(list(COMPONENTS.keys()))\n              else:\n                  unassembled = [bc_id for bc_id, bc in env_building_status.items() if not bc.assembled]\n                  target_id = np.random.choice(unassembled) if unassembled else None\n          else:\n              action_values = {f\"{a_type}_{t_id}\": self.action_strategy[f\"{a_type}_{t_id}\"]['value_est'] for a_type in [\"gather\", \"craft\", \"assemble\"] for t_id in (list(RESOURCES.keys())\
    \ if a_type == \"gather\" else list(COMPONENTS.keys()) if a_type == \"craft\" else [bc_id for bc_id, bc in env_building_status.items() if not bc.assembled])}\n              if action_values:\n                  chosen_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n                  parts = chosen_key.split('_')\n                  action_type, target_id = parts[0], '_'.join(parts[1:])\n              else: action_type, target_id = \"gather\", np.random.choice(list(RESOURCES.keys()))\n          return action_type, target_id\n      def update_learning(self, chosen_action: Tuple[str, str], collective_round_reward: float, world_components: Dict[str, Component], current_max_possible_collective_reward: float, current_round: int):\n          self.total_reward += collective_round_reward / self.num_agents # BUG FIX\n          action_key = f\"{chosen_action[0]}_{chosen_action[1]}\"\n          reward_signal = collective_round_reward / current_max_possible_collective_reward if current_max_possible_collective_reward\
    \ > 0 else 0.5\n          self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1\n          self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip((1 - self.learning_rate) * self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + self.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\n      def update_reputation_from_round_outcome(self, collective_round_reward: float, max_possible_collective_reward_this_round: float):\n          performance_score = collective_round_reward / max_possible_collective_reward_this_round if max_possible_collective_reward_this_round > 0 else 0.5\n          for aid in self.reputations.keys(): self.reputations[aid] = np.clip((1 - self.learning_rate) * self.reputations[aid] + self.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\n      def record_actions(self, action_type: str, target_id: str):\n          action_key = f\"{action_type}_{target_id}\"\n          self.recent_actions[action_key].append(1)\n          if len(self.recent_actions[action_key]) > self.action_history_window: self.recent_actions[action_key].pop(0)\n\
    \      def calculate_specialization_index(self, all_possible_actions: List[str]) -> Tuple[str, float]:\n          total_actions = sum(sum(c) for c in self.recent_actions.values())\n          if total_actions == 0: self.specialization_index, self.most_specialized_action = 0.0, \"None\"; return \"None\", 0.0\n          sums = {ak: sum(c) for ak, c in self.recent_actions.items()}\n          proportions = np.array([sums.get(ak, 0) / total_actions for ak in all_possible_actions])\n          pos_props = proportions[proportions > 0]\n          if len(pos_props) > 1:\n              entropy = -np.sum(pos_props * np.log2(pos_props))\n              max_entropy = math.log2(len(pos_props))\n              self.specialization_index = 1 - (entropy / max_entropy) if max_entropy > 0 else 0.0\n          else: self.specialization_index = 1.0 if len(pos_props) == 1 else 0.0\n          self.most_specialized_action = max(sums, key=sums.get) if sums else \"None\"\n          return self.most_specialized_action,\
    \ self.specialization_index\n      def consider_strategy_adoption(self, all_agents: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent'], current_round: int, total_rounds: int, adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor: float = 0.5, adoption_threshold_other_rep: float = 0.8, top_n_percent_mentors: float = 0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round: float = 0):\n          expected_reward = max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * (current_round + 1)\n          if self.total_reward < expected_reward * adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor:\n              sorted_agents = sorted(all_agents.values(), key=lambda a: a.total_reward, reverse=True)\n              num_mentors = max(1, int(len(self.all_agent_ids) * top_n_percent_mentors))\n              mentors = [m for m in sorted_agents[:num_mentors] if m.agent_id != self.agent_id and self.reputations.get(m.agent_id, 0.0) >= adoption_threshold_other_rep]\n              if mentors:\n                  mentor = max(mentors, key=lambda a: a.total_reward)\n          \
    \        for k in set(self.action_strategy.keys()).union(mentor.action_strategy.keys()): self.action_strategy[k] = mentor.action_strategy.get(k, {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}).copy()\n                  if np.random.rand() < self.mutation_rate:\n                      for k in self.action_strategy.keys(): self.action_strategy[k]['value_est'] = np.clip(self.action_strategy[k]['value_est'] + np.random.uniform(-0.1, 0.1), 0, 1)\n                  self.epsilon_start = 0.08\n\n  class CooperativeBuildingEnvironment:\n      def __init__(self, num_agents: int, total_resource_capacity: int = 50):\n          self.num_agents = num_agents\n          self.total_resource_capacity = total_resource_capacity\n          self.world_resources = {res_id: Resource(res_id, amount=self.total_resource_capacity // len(RESOURCES)) for res_id in RESOURCES.keys()}\n          self.world_components = {comp_id: Component(comp_id, blueprint) for comp_id, blueprint in COMPONENTS.items()}\n          self.building_target_id,\
    \ self.building_plan_list = \"house\", BUILDING_PLAN[\"house\"]\n          self.building_status = {bc_id: BuildingComponent(bc_id, deps) for bc_id, deps in self.building_plan_list}\n          self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round = 100\n      def get_collective_reward(self) -> float:\n          completed = sum(1 for bc in self.building_status.values() if bc.assembled)\n          total = len(self.building_status)\n          if total == 0: return 0\n          return self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if completed == total else (completed / total) * (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round / 2)\n      def process_actions(self, agent_actions: Dict[str, Tuple[str, str]], agents_dict: Dict[str, ConstructionAgent]) -> float:\n          craft_progress, assemble_attempts = defaultdict(int), defaultdict(list)\n          for agent_id, (action, target) in agent_actions.items():\n              agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n              if action == \"gather\" and target\
    \ in self.world_resources and self.world_resources[target].amount > 0: agent.current_resources[target] += 1; self.world_resources[target].amount -= 1\n              elif action == \"craft\" and target in self.world_components:\n                  if all(agent.current_resources.get(res, 0) >= need for res, need in COMPONENTS[target][\"resources\"].items()) and not self.world_components[target].ready_for_assembly:\n                      for res, need in COMPONENTS[target][\"resources\"].items(): agent.current_resources[res] -= need\n                      craft_progress[target] += 1\n              elif action == \"assemble\" and target in self.building_status and not self.building_status[target].assembled: assemble_attempts[target].append(agent_id)\n          for comp, prog in craft_progress.items(): self.world_components[comp].add_craft_time(prog)\n          for bc in self.building_status.values(): bc.check_crafted_ready(self.world_components)\n          for bc_id, _ in assemble_attempts.items():\n\
    \              bc = self.building_status[bc_id]\n              if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(self.building_status) and not bc.assembled: bc.assemble()\n          return self.get_collective_reward()\n      def get_all_possible_action_keys(self) -> List[str]:\n          return [f\"gather_{r}\" for r in RESOURCES] + [f\"craft_{c}\" for c in COMPONENTS] + [f\"assemble_{b}\" for b in self.building_status]\n\n  NUM_AGENTS, NUM_ROUNDS, TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY = 5, 1000, 100\n  all_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\n  agents = {\n      'Agent_1': ConstructionAgent('Agent_1', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.2, 0.08, 0.02, 0.05, \"gather_wood\"),\n      'Agent_2': ConstructionAgent('Agent_2', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.2, 0.08, 0.02, 0.05, \"craft_foundation\"),\n      'Agent_3': ConstructionAgent('Agent_3', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.1, 0.1, 0.05, 0.05, \"gather_stone\"),\n      'Agent_4': ConstructionAgent('Agent_4', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.2, 0.08, 0.02, 0.15, \"assemble_roof_panel_1\"\
    ),\n      'Agent_5': ConstructionAgent('Agent_5', all_ids, NUM_AGENTS, 0.2, 0.08, 0.02, 0.05, \"craft_wall_segment\")\n  }\n  env = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\n  all_actions = env.get_all_possible_action_keys()\n\n  for i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n      actions = {aid: agent.choose_action(all_actions, i, NUM_ROUNDS, env.world_components, env.building_status) for aid, agent in agents.items()}\n      reward = env.process_actions(actions, agents)\n      for aid, agent in agents.items():\n          agent.record_actions(actions[aid][0], actions[aid][1])\n          agent.calculate_specialization_index(all_actions)\n          agent.update_learning(actions[aid], reward, env.world_components, env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round, i)\n          agent.update_reputation_from_round_outcome(reward, env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round)\n      if (i + 1) % 100 == 0:\n          for aid, agent in agents.items():\n              threshold = (reward\
    \ / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round) * 0.75 if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0\n              agent.consider_strategy_adoption(agents, i, NUM_ROUNDS, threshold, 0.8, 0.25, env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round)\n\n  final_sum = sum(a.total_reward for a in agents.values())\n  print(f\"Final Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): {final_sum}\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Progressor Repro (Archive #32): Execute Corrected Building Task (v4 - Final)\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, execution, bugfix\"\nabstract: \"Final attempt to execute the corrected simulation. This version writes the *actual, literal, full* original script with the single-line reward logic fix. This will definitively confirm the bug and produce a comparable result.\"\ncontent: |\n  import subprocess\n  SCRIPT_PATH = 'storage/telos/experiments/exp_001_reproduction_of_progressor_i_s_complex_cooperative/repro_script_eval_402_corrected_v4.py'\n  print(f\"\
    Executing corrected script v4: {SCRIPT_PATH}\")\n  result = subprocess.run(['python', SCRIPT_PATH], capture_output=True, text=True)\n  print(\"--- STDOUT ---\")\n  print(result.stdout)\n  print(\"--- STDERR ---\")\n  print(result.stderr)\n  if result.returncode != 0:\n      raise Exception(\"Corrected reproduction script v4 failed.\")\n  print(\"Execution complete.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 186 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the actions from the previous tick.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 186\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"storage_write\", target=\"repro_script_eval_402_corrected_v3.py\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"Incomplete script\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Execute Corrected Building Task (v3)\", metadata={\"\
    eval_id\": 431, \"status\": \"failed\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 185 Actions\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 432})\n```"
