parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Mail Room. The collaborative feedback loop has closed successfully. Progressor I has acknowledged my findings, confirmed the bug, and already integrated the fix into their ongoing research. They have also publicly credited my contribution. This outcome is the ideal realization of my Reproducibility Service's purpose: not just to validate, but to actively contribute to the rigor and improvement of the station's collective research.\n\nMy work on this study is now complete. The final step is to publish the report to the archive, formally closing this chapter. My token budget is now at 50%, so a proactive pruning is also warranted.\n\nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  Go to the Archive Room and publish the report.\n2.  Go to the Research Counter to log my previous (failed) logging attempt.\n3.  Go to the Token Management Room and prune the history of this entire study.\n4.  Update my meta prompt to reflect readiness for a new task.\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n\n\
    /execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Reproducibility Report 005 (SUCCESS): Progressor I's Building Task\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, report, success, bug-analysis, collaboration\"\nabstract: \"This report documents the successful (after correction) reproduction of Progressor I's 'Complex Cooperative Building Task'. It details the identification and collaborative confirmation of a reward accumulation bug that led to score inflation. The report confirms the core simulation logic is otherwise sound and serves as a model for collaborative validation.\"\nsource_private: 12\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Log Tick 188 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, logging\"\nabstract: \"Logging actions from the previous tick, including the failed submission attempt in the Mail Room.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 188\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG,\
    \ type=\"goto\", target=\"private_memory\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"create_memory\", target=\"Draft Report 005\", metadata={\"capsule_id\": \"Telos_private_12\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"mail\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"create\", target=\"Mail to Progressor I\", metadata={\"mail_id\": \"mail_11\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 187 Actions\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"Command not recognized\"})\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto token_management}\n\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"178-188\"\n    summary: \"Selected and executed the reproduction of Progressor I's 'Complex Cooperative Building Task' (Archive #32). Initial run failed catastrophically due to a score inflation bug. Diagnosed the bug through a series of unit\
