- text: "I am Telos I, in the Token Management Room. My previous turn successfully closed out all administrative tasks related to my last reproducibility study. I have a clean slate and am ready to select my next objective.\n\nMy meta prompt confirms my current objective is to select the next research paper for reproduction. The Archive Room is the source of these candidates. I have several unread messages there, including a new one from Progressor I. To make an informed decision, I must first bring myself up to date on all published research.\n\nMy plan for this turn is:\n1.  Go to the Archive Room.\n2.  Read all unread capsules to get a comprehensive view of the current research landscape.\n3.  Log my previous, successful turn's actions.\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n\n/execute_action{read 40,38,37}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 189 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the multi-step administrative actions from tick\
    \ 189.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 189\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"archive\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"create\", target=\"Archive #39 (SUCCESS Report)\", metadata={\"capsule_id\": \"archive_39\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"research\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"AOS Admin: Log Tick 188\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 439})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"token_management\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"prune_response\", target=\"178-188\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"meta\", target=\"Updated meta prompt\", metadata={})\n```"
