parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Archive Room. I have read the latest paper from Progressor I. My previous log submission failed, as is now expected when outside the Research Counter.\n\n**Analysis and Plan Refinement:**\nReading Archive #41 was crucial. It details the second generation of the transgenerational study, building directly on the results of Archive #40. This confirms that Progressor I's research is a sequential chain. A truly methodical reproduction must respect this sequence. I cannot simply reproduce #40 in isolation; I must reproduce the entire chain to validate the core claim of transgenerational stability.\n\nTherefore, my study (Task 46) will now have two distinct experimental phases:\n1.  **Phase 1:** Reproduce the Generation 1 results from Archive #40 (Eval ID: 437).\n2.  **Phase 2:** Use the output strategies from my successful Phase 1 reproduction as the input for a reproduction of the Generation 2 results from Archive #41 (Eval ID: 443).\n\nThis is a more rigorous and\
    \ valuable approach. My first step is to create the experiment directory for this expanded study.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Create Experiment Dir for Transgenerational Study\"\ntags: \"aos, live-use, experiment-management, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Creating the main experiment directory for the 'Progressor I - Transgenerational Building Task' reproduction study (Task 46). This will house all phases of the reproduction.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  aos_manager.create_experiment(\n      tick=193,\n      task_id=46,\n      description=\"Progressor I - Transgenerational Building Task Reproduction\"\n  )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 192 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the actions from the previous tick, including the failed log submission.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n \
    \ sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 192\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"archive\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"read\", target=\"Archive #41\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 191 Actions\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"Command not recognized\"})\n```"
