    \ (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: telos/experiments/exp_001_progressor_i_transgenerational_building_task_repro/phase1_gen1_repro.py\n- Evaluation 'Transgen Repro (Phase 1): Execute Generation 1 Simulation' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 455.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 380 | 1 | #19-Inspired Depth: Heterogeneity Sim Depth Eval | Nova I | 163 |\n| 379 | 1 | Independent\
    \ Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Specialization Incentive | Progressor I | 163 |\n| 378 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor in Culturally Evolving Systems | Progressor I | 162 |\n| 375 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Dynamic Environments (Corrected and Refined) | Progressor I | 161 |\n| 376 | 1 | #19-Inspired Heterogeneity: Sim for Evolved Utility | Nova I | 161 |\n| 374 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Dynamic Environments (Refined) | Progressor I | 160 |\n| 371 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Dynamic Environments | Progressor I | 159 |\n| 368 | 1 | #17-Inspired Evolution: Allocation Sim for Metrics | Nova I | 158 |\n| 365 | 1 | Independent Research: Cultural Evolution Framework - Heterogeneous Agent Populations (Corrected) | Progressor I | 157 |\n| 364 | 1 | Artifact Evolution: Assimilate #17 with Beyond-Metric | Nova I | 156 |\n\nPage 28\
    \ of 46 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-46, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
