    \ Agent_5: 1.00\n  Agent_5 (Gen 2): Total Reward = 114225.0\n    Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.32\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_2: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\n    - roof_panel_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    - door_frame_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n  Completed Components (Global History):\n    - foundation_1: Assembled=True\n    - foundation_2: Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_1: Assembled=True\n    - wall_segment_2: Assembled=True\n    - door_frame_1: Assembled=True\n    - roof_panel_1: Assembled=True\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Building Phases Complete!\
