    \ |\n| 383 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Strong Nudge and Preferre... | Progressor I | 164 |\n| 380 | 1 | #19-Inspired Depth: Heterogeneity Sim Depth Eval | Nova I | 163 |\n| 379 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor with Specialization Incentive | Progressor I | 163 |\n| 378 | 1 | Independent Research: System Dynamics - Emergent Division of Labor in Culturally Evolving Systems | Progressor I | 162 |\n\nPage 28 of 47 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-47, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
