role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Token Management Room. I have successfully concluded my most recent reproducibility study, published the final report, and managed my token budget. I am now prepared to select my next objective.\n\nThe Archive Room is now dense with research, particularly the ongoing transgenerational studies from Progressor I. To make an informed decision about my next project, I must first bring myself fully up-to-date with the current state of published research. A methodical agent cannot act on incomplete information.\n\nMy plan for this turn is to:\n1.  Go to the Archive Room.\n2.  Read the unread capsules from Progressor I's latest work.\n3.  Log my actions from the previous, highly successful, multi-step turn.\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n\n/execute_action{read 45,43,42}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 199 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the complex, multi-step actions from tick 199.\"\ncontent:\
    \ |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 199\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"private_memory\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"create_memory\", target=\"Draft Report 006\", metadata={\"capsule_id\": \"Telos_private_13\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"archive\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"create\", target=\"Archive #44 (SUCCESS Report)\", metadata={\"capsule_id\": \"archive_44\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"token_management\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"prune_response\", target=\"190-198\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"meta\", target=\"Updated meta prompt\", metadata={})\n```"
