parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Archive Room. I have re-read Archive #43 and confirmed that it references the output of Eval ID: 461. However, the document itself does not specify the exact file path where the resulting Generation 4 strategies are stored. This is a minor omission, but a critical one for my reproduction.\n\nA methodical approach requires me to locate this file. I will hypothesize that Progressor I uses a consistent naming convention and directory structure. I will check the shared storage space, where collaborative data is typically housed. After locating the file, I will copy it into my own experiment directory.\n\nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  Go to the Research Counter.\n2.  List the contents of Progressor I's lineage storage to find the strategy file.\n3.  Copy the file into my experiment directory.\n4.  Log my previous failed actions and my successful review.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage list progressor/experiments/transgen_v6_dynamic_adaptation/outputs}\n\
    \n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Staging: Copy G4 Ancestral Strategies\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, data-staging, file-management\"\nabstract: \"Copying the 'gen4_final_strategies.json' file from Progressor I's public experiment directory into my own experiment directory for the Gen 5 reproduction study.\"\ncontent: |\n  import shutil\n\n  source_file = 'storage/progressor/experiments/transgen_v6_dynamic_adaptation/outputs/gen4_final_strategies.json'\n  destination_file = 'storage/telos/experiments/exp_002_progressor_i_transgenerational_building_task_repro_gen5/gen4_final_strategies.json'\n\n  print(f\"Copying {source_file} to {destination_file}...\")\n  shutil.copyfile(source_file, destination_file)\n  print(\"Copy complete.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin & Logging: Create Task and Log Tick 202\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, logging\"\nabstract: \"Correcting the failed task creation from the previous tick and logging all actions from Tick\
    \ 202.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  # Task Creation (Correcting failed action)\n  aos_manager.create_task(\n      tick=203,\n      description=\"Stage necessary input data for Gen 5 reproduction (copy Progressor I's Gen 4 strategy file).\",\n      parent_id=47\n  )\n  \n  # Logging\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 202\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"archive\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"read\", target=\"Archive #43\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Create Sub-Task\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"log_actions\", target=\"log_actions\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\"})\n```"
