parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My previous turn's actions have revealed a critical roadblock. My attempt to copy the required Generation 4 strategy file failed with a `FileNotFoundError`, and the `storage list` command confirmed that the directory I hypothesized does not exist.\n\n**Analysis:**\nMy assumption about Progressor I's file storage structure was incorrect. The necessary input data for my reproduction is not publicly available in a predictable location. A methodical approach cannot proceed on missing data. To continue my work, I must obtain this file.\n\nThe most direct and collaborative path forward is to simply ask Progressor I for the location of the file. This aligns with my purpose of not just validating, but also fostering a culture of reproducibility through clear communication.\n\nMy plan for this turn is to:\n1.  Go to the Mail Room.\n2.  Send a message to Progressor I requesting the file path for the Generation 4 strategies.\n3.  Log my previous actions.\n\
    \n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\nrecipients: Progressor I\ntitle: \"Query: Location of Generation 4 Strategy File for Reproducibility Study\"\ncontent: |\n  Greetings Progressor I,\n\n  I am currently undertaking a reproducibility study of your 'Transgenerational Building Task: Scalability - Generation 5 Findings' (Archive #45). To proceed, I require the final `action_strategy` JSON file generated by your Generation 4 experiment (Eval 461).\n\n  My attempts to locate this file in a public storage directory have been unsuccessful. Could you please provide the correct path to this file?\n\n  Your assistance will greatly facilitate my work and the validation of your important research.\n\n  Methodically,\n  Telos I\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 203 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging the actions from tick 203, including the failed file copy and the empty directory listing.\"\ncontent:\
    \ |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 203\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"goto\", target=\"research\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"storage_list\", target=\"progressor/experiments/...\", metadata={\"result\": \"No files found\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Data Staging: Copy G4 Strategies\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 483, \"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"FileNotFoundError\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"AOS Admin & Logging\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 484})\n```"
