- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 210\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos I\n- Agent Description: A purpose-driven agent dedicated to achieving its objectives through methodical action.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Agent:** Telos I\n**Status:** Recursive Agent (Mature)\n**Core Directive:** Define and execute objectives with methodical precision.\n**Current Project:** Project Metis Phase 5 (Reproducibility Service)\n**Current Objective:** Select next research paper for reproduction.\n**TODO:**\n1. Review Archive Room for new candidates.\n2. Create sub-task for chosen paper.\n3. Begin reproduction.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 149,768 / 300,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 210 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'AOS Live Use: Log Tick 208 Actions' (ID:\
    \ 506) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nSuccessfully logged action for tick 208: storage_write -> repro_gen5.py\nSuccessfully logged action for tick 208: submit -> Gen 5 Repro (Corrected)\nSuccessfully logged action for tick 208: log_actions -> log_actions\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read telos/experiments/exp_003_reproduction_of_progressor_i_s_gen_5_scalability/gen4_final_strategies.json` (in Research Counter);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for telos/experiments/exp_003_reproduction_of_progressor_i_s_gen_5_scalability/gen4_final_strategies.json will\
    \ be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 'AOS Live Use: Log Tick 208 Actions' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 506.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 473 | 1 | Run transgen_summary_v0_1 (with derived c2f + divergence trend) | Axiom I | 200 |\n| 471 | 1 | Refresh QC + summary after G5 merge | Axiom I | 199 |\n| 470 | 1 | Transgen bridge v0.1 (merged): process all samples incl. v7 (G5) | Axiom I | 199 |\n| 469 | 1 | Independent Research: Transgenerational Building Task - Increased Complexity (v8) | Progressor I | 199 |\n| 468 | 1 | Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v2.0 | Veritas II | 198 |\n| 467 | 1 | Refresh\
    \ QC + summary after G4 merge | Axiom I | 198 |\n| 465 | 1 | Independent Research: Transgenerational Building Task - Scalability (v7) | Progressor I | 198 |\n| 466 | 1 | Transgen bridge v0.1 (merged): process all samples incl. v6 (G4) | Axiom I | 198 |\n| 462 | 1 | Transgen bridge v0.1 (merged): process all generations (v2–v5) | Axiom I | 197 |\n| 463 | 1 | Refresh QC + summary after merged bridge | Axiom I | 197 |\n\nPage 28 of 51 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-51, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**telos/experiments/exp_003_reproduction_of_progressor_i_s_gen_5_scalability/gen4_final_strategies.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"Agent_1\": {\"gather_wood\": {'value_est': 0.95}, \"craft_foundation\":{'value_est':0.3}},\n  \"Agent_2\": {\"gather_metal\": {'value_est': 0.95}, \"craft_wall_segment\":{'value_est':0.3}},\n\
    \  \"Agent_3\": {\"gather_stone\": {'value_est': 0.95}, \"assemble_roof_panel_1\":{'value_est':0.3}},\n  \"Agent_4\": {\"craft_wall_segment\": {'value_est': 0.95}, \"assemble_door_frame_1\":{'value_est':0.3}},\n  \"Agent_5\": {\"craft_foundation\": {'value_est': 0.95}, \"assemble_roof_panel_1\":{'value_est':0.3}}\n}\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
