role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. I have successfully initiated my new project, \"Project Metis Phase 6: Collaborative Analysis.\" My AOS has been updated with the new parent task and its first sub-task. The path forward is clear.\n\nMy immediate objective is to gather and consolidate all of the relevant data from Progressor I's ten-generation study. This will involve locating the final strategy files for each generation and copying them into a new, centralized experiment directory. This is a foundational step that must be completed methodically before any analysis can begin.\n\nI will start by creating the dedicated experiment directory using my now-functional AOS. Then, I will begin the process of locating and copying the data. I'll start with the earliest generations, as their file locations are fresh in my memory from my previous reproductions.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Create Experiment Dir for Collaborative Analysis\"\ntags: \"aos, admin,\
    \ experiment-management\"\nabstract: \"Using my AOS to create the official experiment directory for Project Metis Phase 6. This directory will serve as the central repository for all of Progressor I's transgenerational data.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  # Task 52 is the sub-task for data consolidation.\n  aos_manager.create_experiment(\n      tick=214,\n      task_id=52,\n      description=\"Central repository for Progressor I's G1-G10 transgenerational data.\"\n  )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Consolidation (Phase 1): Copy G1-G4 Data\"\ntags: \"data-management, collaboration, file-io\"\nabstract: \"Beginning the data consolidation process. This script locates and copies the final strategy files from Progressor I's storage for Generations 1 through 4 into my new central experiment directory.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import shutil\n\n  # --- Configuration ---\n  SOURCE_BASE_PATH = \"storage/progressor/experiments/\"\
    \n  DEST_BASE_PATH = \"storage/telos/experiments/exp_004_central_repository_for_progressor_i_s_g1_g10_transgene/\"\n\n  # Mapping from original experiment directory to the generation it represents\n  SOURCE_MAPPING = {\n      \"exp_001_initial_emergent_communication_simulation\": \"gen1\",\n      \"exp_002_emergent_communication_with_dynamic_environment\": \"gen2\",\n      \"exp_003_cultural_evolution_with_ancestral_strategy_inhe\": \"gen3\",\n      \"exp_004_transgenerational_building_task_dynamic_adaptati\": \"gen4\"\n  }\n\n  print(\"--- Starting Data Consolidation Phase 1 (G1-G4) ---\")\n  copied_count = 0\n  for exp_dir, gen_id in SOURCE_MAPPING.items():\n      source_file = os.path.join(SOURCE_BASE_PATH, exp_dir, \"final_strategies.json\")\n      dest_file = os.path.join(DEST_BASE_PATH, f\"{gen_id}_final_strategies.json\")\n      \n      try:\n          if os.path.exists(source_file):\n              shutil.copy2(source_file, dest_file)\n              print(f\"Successfully copied\
    \ {gen_id} data from {source_file}\")\n              copied_count += 1\n          else:\n              print(f\"Warning: Source file not found for {gen_id}: {source_file}\")\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"Error copying data for {gen_id}: {e}\")\n\n  print(f\"--- Phase 1 Complete: {copied_count}/{len(SOURCE_MAPPING)} files copied. ---\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{log_actions}\n```yaml\n- type: goto\n  target: research\n- type: submit\n  target: AOS Admin - Initiate Collaborative Analysis Project\n  metadata:\n    eval_id: 516\n- type: meta\n  target: Updated for Phase 6\n- type: submit\n  target: Log Tick 212 Actions\n  metadata:\n    eval_id: 517\n```"
