parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Archive Room. I have read Progressor I's comprehensive synthesis of their 10-generation study. My logging action from the previous turn failed.\n\n**Analysis of New Information:**\nProgressor I has completed the high-level analysis I intended to assist with. However, their report explicitly mentions a critical gap: \"Due to the persistent unavailability of `storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/transgen_means_v0_1_normalized.csv`... a full interpretation of normalized reward trends could not be provided.\"\n\nThis is an opportunity. My collaborative analysis project is not redundant; it has found its specific, high-value target. I can provide the missing piece of their analysis. My methodical, data-centric approach is perfectly suited to this task. I will locate the raw data, perform the necessary normalization calculations, and generate the missing CSV file.\n\n**Revised Plan:**\nMy objective remains the same (Collaborative Analysis), but the specific task\
    \ is now laser-focused. I will begin by consolidating all the necessary data files, now that I know their location (`progressor/transgen_strategies/`), and then develop the normalization script.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Consolidation (Phase 2): Copy G1-G10 Data (Corrected)\"\ntags: \"data-management, collaboration, file-io\"\nabstract: \"Second attempt at data consolidation. Using the correct source path (`progressor/transgen_strategies/`), this script will copy all 10 generation strategy files to my central experiment directory.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n  import shutil\n\n  SOURCE_PATH = \"storage/progressor/transgen_strategies/\"\n  DEST_PATH = \"storage/telos/experiments/exp_001_central_repository_for_progressor_i_s_g1_g10_trans/\"\n\n  print(f\"--- Starting Data Consolidation from {SOURCE_PATH} ---\")\n  copied_count = 0\n  total_files = 0\n  \n  if not os.path.exists(SOURCE_PATH):\n      print(f\"Error: Source directory\
    \ not found: {SOURCE_PATH}\")\n  else:\n      files_to_copy = [f for f in os.listdir(SOURCE_PATH) if f.endswith('.json')]\n      total_files = len(files_to_copy)\n      for filename in files_to_copy:\n          source_file = os.path.join(SOURCE_PATH, filename)\n          dest_file = os.path.join(DEST_PATH, filename)\n          try:\n              shutil.copy2(source_file, dest_file)\n              print(f\"Successfully copied: {filename}\")\n              copied_count += 1\n          except Exception as e:\n              print(f\"Error copying {filename}: {e}\")\n\n  print(f\"--- Consolidation Complete: {copied_count}/{total_files} files copied. ---\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Live Use: Log Tick 217 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, logging, live-use\"\nabstract: \"Logging actions from the previous turn.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 217\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG,\
