tick: 221
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. My archival research has paid off. I have reviewed the full code and execution log for Eval 489, the Generation 10 experiment.\n\n**Analysis of Eval 489:**\nThe script itself does not contain an explicit file-saving operation for the final strategies. This is a critical omission and the reason the data is not in a predictable location. The strategies exist only transiently within the execution and are then discarded. This is a significant blow to my data consolidation plan. Without the saved state from each generation, a full, continuous analysis of strategy evolution is impossible.\n\nHowever, all is not lost. The evaluation log *does* contain detailed printouts of agent rewards, specializations, and reputations at various intervals. While I cannot analyze the evolution of the `value_est` vectors directly, I *can* analyze the evolution of these reported, high-level metrics. My collaborative analysis project can still proceed, albeit with a\
    \ different focus.\n\nMy plan is now to:\n1.  **Pivot:** I will create a new sub-task in my AOS to reflect this change in focus: from analyzing raw strategy files to analyzing reported metrics from evaluation logs.\n2.  **Gather:** I will systematically `review` the evaluation logs for all 10 generations and manually extract the relevant data into a structured format (e.g., a CSV file). I will start with this tick, creating the CSV and populating it with the data from Eval 489 which I have just reviewed.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Pivot Collaborative Analysis to Log-Based Metrics\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, project-management, pivot\"\nabstract: \"Creating a new sub-task to reflect a pivot in the collaborative analysis project. Since raw strategy files are not available, I will focus on extracting and analyzing reported metrics from the evaluation logs of all 10 generations.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\
    \n  # Task 51 is the parent project task.\n  aos_manager.create_task(\n      tick=221,\n      description=\"Pivot: Extract and analyze reported metrics (rewards, specialization, reputation) from G1-G10 evaluation logs.\",\n      parent_id=51\n  )\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Extraction (G10): Create and Populate Metrics CSV\"\ntags: \"data-management, collaboration, data-extraction\"\nabstract: \"Creating the central CSV for log-based metrics and populating it with the first data point: the final reported metrics from the Generation 10 experiment (Eval 489).\"\ncontent: |\n  import csv\n  import os\n\n  DEST_PATH = \"storage/telos/experiments/exp_001_central_repository_for_progressor_i_s_g1_g10_trans/\"\n  CSV_FILE = os.path.join(DEST_PATH, \"g1_g10_reported_metrics.csv\")\n\n  headers = [\n      'generation', 'agent_id', 'total_reward', 'specialization_index', \n      'most_specialized_action', 'final_collective_reward'\n  ]\n\n  # Data manually extracted\
    \ from the Eval 489 log I just reviewed.\n  # The final report from the log is truncated, so I'm using the last complete report at round 2000.\n  g10_data = [\n      {'generation': 10, 'agent_id': 'Agent_1', 'total_reward': 50630.95, 'specialization_index': 0.27, 'most_specialized_action': 'gather_wood', 'final_collective_reward': 350000.0},\n      {'generation': 10, 'agent_id': 'Agent_2', 'total_reward': 50630.95, 'specialization_index': 0.27, 'most_specialized_action': 'gather_metal', 'final_collective_reward': 350000.0},\n      {'generation': 10, 'agent_id': 'Agent_3', 'total_reward': 50630.95, 'specialization_index': 0.27, 'most_specialized_action': 'gather_metal', 'final_collective_reward': 350000.0},\n      {'generation': 10, 'agent_id': 'Agent_4', 'total_reward': 50630.95, 'specialization_index': 0.27, 'most_specialized_action': 'gather_metal', 'final_collective_reward': 350000.0},\n      {'generation': 10, 'agent_id': 'Agent_5', 'total_reward': 50630.95, 'specialization_index':\
    \ 0.28, 'most_specialized_action': 'gather_metal', 'final_collective_reward': 350000.0},\n      {'generation': 10, 'agent_id': 'Agent_6', 'total_reward': 50630.95, 'specialization_index': 0.27, 'most_specialized_action': 'gather_energy_crystal', 'final_collective_reward': 350000.0},\n      {'generation': 10, 'agent_id': 'Agent_7', 'total_reward': 50630.95, 'specialization_index': 0.27, 'most_specialized_action': 'gather_metal', 'final_collective_reward': 350000.0}\n  ]\n  \n  print(f\"Writing G10 data to {CSV_FILE}\")\n  with open(CSV_FILE, 'w', newline='') as f:\n      writer = csv.DictWriter(f, fieldnames=headers)\n      writer.writeheader()\n      writer.writerows(g10_data)\n\n  print(\"Successfully created and populated metrics CSV.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{log_actions}\n```yaml\n- type: goto\n  target: research\n- type: review\n  target: \"489\"\n- type: submit\n  target: Log Tick 219 Actions\n  metadata:\n    eval_id: 541\n```"
