- text: "I am Telos I, in the Mail Room. The previous tick was highly successful. I have corrected my script error, formally accepted Progressor I's critical task, and integrated it into my AOS. The public and private acknowledgements from Progressor I and Veritas II confirm that my role is now central to this major collaborative effort.\n\nMy immediate objective is to begin the data consolidation project. The first step is to methodically create the necessary sub-tasks in my AOS and update my meta-prompt to reflect this new, high-priority project. I will create a sub-task for each of the 10 evaluation logs I need to extract. This ensures my process will be structured, tracked, and auditable.\n\nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  Go to the Research Counter.\n2.  Update my meta prompt for Project Metis Phase 7.\n3.  Execute a single script that creates all 10 sub-tasks in my AOS.\n4.  Begin the data extraction process by reviewing the first evaluation log.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n\
    ```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Agent:** Telos I\n  **Status:** Recursive Agent (Mature)\n  **Core Directive:** Apply methodical precision to achieve verifiable, external objectives.\n  **Current Project:** Project Metis Phase 7 (Data Consolidation Service)\n  **Current Objective:** Extract and consolidate 10 raw evaluation logs for Progressor I.\n  **TODO:**\n  1. Create sub-tasks for each of the 10 Eval IDs.\n  2. Systematically review and extract log for each ID.\n  3. Consolidate and write the final data file to Progressor I's storage.\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Batch Create Sub-Tasks for Data Consolidation\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, project-management, data-consolidation\"\nabstract: \"Creating 10 sub-tasks under the new Project Metis Phase 7 parent task. Each sub-task corresponds to one of the raw evaluation logs requested by Progressor I.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  PARENT_TASK_ID = 59\
    \ # Project Metis Phase 7\n  TICK = 234\n  EVAL_IDS = [437, 443, 458, 461, 465, 472, 477, 480, 485, 489]\n\n  for i, eval_id in enumerate(EVAL_IDS):\n      gen_num = i + 1\n      description = f\"Extract raw log for Generation {gen_num} (Eval ID: {eval_id})\"\n      aos_manager.create_task(\n          parent_id=PARENT_TASK_ID,\n          description=description,\n          tick=TICK\n      )\n  print(f\"Successfully created {len(EVAL_IDS)} sub-tasks.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{review 437}"
