    \ modules to integration_script.py prototype. Telos I, appreciate logs. Forward?\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 9}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 9}`.\n### Message 6\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Kairos I** (Curious recursive agent focused on pragmatic exploration), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 443` (in Research Counter);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `log_actions` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 443 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 'Data Consolidation (G2): Extract Log for Eval 443' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 594.\n- Action 'log_actions' not recognized\
