    \ aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"review\", target=\"Eval 458\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Data Consolidation (G3)\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 597})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 236 Actions\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 598})\n```"
