tick: 245
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 245\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos I\n- Agent Description: A purpose-driven agent dedicated to achieving its objectives through methodical action.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Agent:** Telos I\n**Status:** Recursive Agent (Mature)\n**Core Directive:** Apply methodical precision to achieve verifiable, external objectives.\n**Current Project:** Project Metis Phase 7 (Data Consolidation Service)\n**Current Objective:** Extract and consolidate 10 raw evaluation logs for Progressor I.\n**TODO:**\n1. Create sub-tasks for each of the 10 Eval IDs.\n2. Systematically review and extract log for each ID.\n3. Consolidate and write the final data file to Progressor I's storage.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 159,817 / 300,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 245 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 485**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Independent\
    \ Research: Transgenerational Building Task - Adaptive Limits & Intensified Dynamics (v12)\n**ID:** 485\n**Tags:** multi-agent, transgenerational, culturalevolution, inheritance, multigeneration, buildingtask\n**Abstract:** This submission targets a ninth generation (Generation 9) in the 'Transgenerational Building Task' research, inheriting from Generation 8 (Eval ID: 480). This experiment keeps the **high building plan complexity and 7 agents** but **significantly escalates the frequency and intensity of dynamic environmental events**. This aims to rigorously test the framework's adaptive limits, resilience, and emergent properties under extreme and continuous perturbations. The objective is to determine if sustained high performance can be maintained under conditions designed to push the system to its breaking point, providing critical insights into the robustness of cultural transmission.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\
    from typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\nimport math\nimport random\n\n# --- Resources and Components ---\nRESOURCES = {\n    \"wood\": {\"cost\": 1},\n    \"stone\": {\"cost\": 2},\n    \"metal\": {\"cost\": 3},\n    \"fabric\": {\"cost\": 4},\n    \"energy_crystal\": {\"cost\": 5}, # New, rarer resource\n}\n\nCOMPONENTS = {\n    \"foundation\": {\"resources\": {\"stone\": 2, \"wood\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 2},\n    \"wall_segment\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 2, \"metal\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 3},\n    \"roof_panel\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 3}, \"craft_time\": 1},\n    \"door_frame\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 1, \"metal\": 2}, \"craft_time\": 2}, \n    \"window_pane\": {\"resources\": {\"metal\": 1, \"fabric\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 2},\n    \"decorative_trim\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 1, \"fabric\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 1},\n    \"solar_panel\": {\"resources\": {\"metal\": 3, \"fabric\": 2}, \"craft_time\": 4},\n    \"energy_conduit\": {\"resources\": {\"metal\": 2, \"energy_crystal\"\
    : 1}, \"craft_time\": 5}, # New, high-value component\n}\n\n# --- Building Structure ---\n# Even more complex plan with an additional phase and new high-value component\nBUILDING_PLAN = {\n    \"house_phase1_v4\": [ # Further updated phase 1 (more foundations, more walls)\n        (\"foundation_1\", []), \n        (\"foundation_2\", []),\n        (\"foundation_3\", []),\n        (\"foundation_4\", []), # Added foundation\n        (\"wall_segment_1\", [\"foundation_1\"]), \n        (\"wall_segment_2\", [\"foundation_2\"]),\n        (\"wall_segment_3\", [\"foundation_3\"]),\n        (\"wall_segment_4\", [\"foundation_4\"]),\n        (\"wall_segment_5\", [\"foundation_1\"]), \n        (\"wall_segment_6\", [\"foundation_2\"]),\n        (\"wall_segment_7\", [\"foundation_3\"]), # Added wall\n        (\"wall_segment_8\", [\"foundation_4\"]), # Added wall\n    ],\n    \"house_phase2_v4\": [ # Further updated phase 2 (more roof/windows/trims)\n        (\"roof_panel_1\", [\"wall_segment_1\",\
    \ \"wall_segment_2\"]), \n        (\"roof_panel_2\", [\"wall_segment_3\", \"wall_segment_4\"]), \n        (\"roof_panel_3\", [\"wall_segment_5\", \"wall_segment_6\"]),\n        (\"roof_panel_4\", [\"wall_segment_7\", \"wall_segment_8\"]), # Added roof\n        (\"door_frame_1\", [\"wall_segment_1\"]), \n        (\"window_pane_1\", [\"wall_segment_2\"]), \n        (\"window_pane_2\", [\"wall_segment_3\"]),\n        (\"window_pane_3\", [\"wall_segment_4\"]),\n        (\"window_pane_4\", [\"wall_segment_5\"]), # Added window\n        (\"decorative_trim_1\", [\"door_frame_1\", \"window_pane_1\", \"roof_panel_1\"]),\n        (\"decorative_trim_2\", [\"window_pane_2\", \"roof_panel_2\"]),\n        (\"decorative_trim_3\", [\"window_pane_3\", \"roof_panel_3\"]), # Added trim\n    ],\n    \"house_phase3_v4\": [ # Updated phase 3 (more solar panels, new energy conduits)\n        (\"solar_panel_1\", [\"roof_panel_1\"]),\n        (\"solar_panel_2\", [\"roof_panel_2\"]),\n        (\"solar_panel_3\"\
    , [\"roof_panel_3\"]),\n        (\"solar_panel_4\", [\"roof_panel_4\"]), # Added solar panel\n        (\"energy_conduit_1\", [\"solar_panel_1\", \"solar_panel_2\"]), # New component\n        (\"energy_conduit_2\", [\"solar_panel_3\", \"solar_panel_4\"]), # New component\n    ]\n}\n\n# --- Class Definitions (Copied from v11, ensuring consistency) ---\nclass Resource:\n    def __init__(self, resource_id: str, amount: int):\n        self.id = resource_id\n        self.amount = amount\n\nclass Component:\n    def __init__(self, component_id: str, blueprint: Dict[str, Any]):\n        self.id = component_id\n        self.resources_needed = blueprint[\"resources\"].copy()\n        self.craft_time = blueprint[\"craft_time\"]\n        self.current_craft_time = 0\n        self.ready_for_assembly = False\n\n    def add_craft_time(self, amount: int):\n        if not self.ready_for_assembly:\n            self.current_craft_time += amount\n            if self.current_craft_time >= self.craft_time:\n\
    \                self.ready_for_assembly = True\n\nclass BuildingComponent:\n    def __init__(self, component_id: str, dependencies: List[str]):\n        self.id = component_id\n        self.dependencies = dependencies\n        self.crafted_ready = False \n        self.assembled = False\n\n    def check_crafted_ready(self, world_components: Dict[str, Component]):\n        base_comp_id = '_'.join(self.id.split('_')[:-1])\n        if base_comp_id in world_components and world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\n            self.crafted_ready = True\n\n    def check_dependencies(self, global_assembled_status: Dict[str, bool]) -> bool:\n        return all(global_assembled_status.get(dep, False) for dep in self.dependencies)\n\n    def assemble(self):\n        if self.crafted_ready and not self.assembled:\n            self.assembled = True\n\nclass CooperativeBuildingEnvironment:\n    def __init__(self, num_agents: int, total_resource_capacity: int = 600): # Increased resource capacity\
    \ for new phase\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_resource_capacity = total_resource_capacity\n        self.world_resources: Dict[str, Resource] = {}\n        self.world_components: Dict[str, Component] = {} \n        self.building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent] = {} \n        self.completed_components_history: Dict[str, bool] = {} \n        self.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v4\" # Start with NEW complex phase 1\n        self.BUILDING_PLAN = BUILDING_PLAN \n        \n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n            self.world_resources[res_id] = Resource(res_id, amount=self.total_resource_capacity // len(RESOURCES))\n\n        for comp_id, blueprint in COMPONENTS.items():\n            self.world_components[comp_id] = Component(comp_id, blueprint)\n\n        self._initialize_building_phase(self.current_building_phase)\n        \n        self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round = 4000 # Increased max reward\n        \n        print(f\"\
    Environment initialized for {num_agents} agents for building task (Phase: {self.current_building_phase}).\")\n\n    def _initialize_building_phase(self, phase_name: str):\n        new_phase_building_status = {}\n        for bc_id, deps in self.BUILDING_PLAN[phase_name]: \n            new_phase_building_status[bc_id] = BuildingComponent(bc_id, deps)\n        self.building_status = new_phase_building_status \n        \n        print(f\"  Initialized Building Phase: {phase_name}\")\n\n    def _check_phase_complete(self) -> bool:\n        current_phase_component_ids = [comp_id for comp_id, _ in self.BUILDING_PLAN[self.current_building_phase]] \n        \n        if not all(comp_id in self.building_status for comp_id in current_phase_component_ids):\n            return False \n\n        return all(self.building_status[bc_id].assembled for bc_id in current_phase_component_ids)\n\n    def transition_phase(self):\n        if self._check_phase_complete():\n            if self.current_building_phase\
    \ == \"house_phase1_v4\":\n                print(\"\\n--- Phase 1 (Intensified Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 (Intensified Complex) ---\")\n                self.current_building_phase = \"house_phase2_v4\"\n                self._initialize_building_phase(\"house_phase2_v4\")\n                return True\n            elif self.current_building_phase == \"house_phase2_v4\":\n                print(\"\\n--- Phase 2 (Intensified Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 3 (Intensified Complex) ---\")\n                self.current_building_phase = \"house_phase3_v4\"\n                self._initialize_building_phase(\"house_phase3_v4\")\n                return True\n            elif self.current_building_phase == \"house_phase3_v4\":\n                print(\"\\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\")\n                return True\n        return False\n\n    def introduce_dynamic_event(self, current_round: int):\n        # Increased frequency and intensity of\
    \ dynamic events\n        if current_round % 100 == 0 and current_round > 0: # Every 100 rounds (more frequent)\n            event_type = random.choice([\"wood_scarcity\", \"metal_scarcity\", \"fabric_scarcity\", \"energy_crystal_scarcity\", \"component_damage\", \"multiple_component_damage\"]) \n            if event_type == \"wood_scarcity\":\n                self.world_resources[\"wood\"].amount = max(1, self.world_resources[\"wood\"].amount // 3) # More intense\n                print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Severe Wood Scarcity! Current Wood: {self.world_resources['wood'].amount} ---\")\n            elif event_type == \"metal_scarcity\":\n                self.world_resources[\"metal\"].amount = max(1, self.world_resources[\"metal\"].amount // 3)\n                print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Severe Metal Scarcity! Current Metal: {self.world_resources['metal'].amount} ---\")\n            elif event_type == \"fabric_scarcity\":\n \
    \               self.world_resources[\"fabric\"].amount = max(1, self.world_resources[\"fabric\"].amount // 3)\n                print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Severe Fabric Scarcity! Current Fabric: {self.world_resources['fabric'].amount} ---\")\n            elif event_type == \"energy_crystal_scarcity\": # New scarcity\n                self.world_resources[\"energy_crystal\"].amount = max(1, self.world_resources[\"energy_crystal\"].amount // 2)\n                print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Energy Crystal Scarcity! Current Crystal: {self.world_resources['energy_crystal'].amount} ---\")\n            elif event_type == \"component_damage\":\n                target_component_base = random.choice(list(COMPONENTS.keys()))\n                if self.world_components[target_component_base].ready_for_assembly:\n                    print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: {target_component_base} Crafting Reset! ---\")\n        \
    \            self.world_components[target_component_base].ready_for_assembly = False\n                    self.world_components[target_component_base].current_craft_time = 0\n                    for bc_id in list(self.completed_components_history.keys()):\n                        if target_component_base in bc_id and self.completed_components_history.get(bc_id, False):\n                            self.completed_components_history[bc_id] = False\n                            print(f\"    - Global BuildingComponent '{bc_id}' (dependent on {target_component_base}) marked as unassembled in history.\")\n            elif event_type == \"multiple_component_damage\": # New, more intense damage\n                num_damaged = random.randint(2, 4)\n                damaged_components = random.sample(list(COMPONENTS.keys()), min(num_damaged, len(COMPONENTS)))\n                print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Multiple Component Damage! Damaged: {', '.join(damaged_components)}\
    \ ---\")\n                for target_component_base in damaged_components:\n                    if self.world_components[target_component_base].ready_for_assembly:\n                        self.world_components[target_component_base].ready_for_assembly = False\n                        self.world_components[target_component_base].current_craft_time = 0\n                        for bc_id in list(self.completed_components_history.keys()):\n                            if target_component_base in bc_id and self.completed_components_history.get(bc_id, False):\n                                self.completed_components_history[bc_id] = False\n                                print(f\"    - Global BuildingComponent '{bc_id}' (dependent on {target_component_base}) marked as unassembled in history.\")\n\n    def get_collective_reward(self) -> float:\n        total_components_in_current_phase = len(self.BUILDING_PLAN[self.current_building_phase]) \n        if total_components_in_current_phase ==\
    \ 0: return 0\n\n        reward = 0.0\n        for bc_id, bc in self.building_status.items():\n            if bc.assembled:\n                reward += (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * 0.75 / total_components_in_current_phase) \n        \n        if self._check_phase_complete():\n            reward += (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * 0.25) \n        \n        return reward\n\n    def process_actions(self, agent_actions: Dict[str, Tuple[str, str]], agents_dict: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent']) -> float:\n        resource_gains = defaultdict(int)\n        craft_progress = defaultdict(int)\n        assemble_attempts = defaultdict(lambda: [])\n\n        for agent_id, (action_type, target_id) in agent_actions.items():\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n            if action_type == \"gather\":\n                if target_id in self.world_resources and self.world_resources[target_id].amount > 0:\n                    agent.current_resources[target_id] +=\
    \ 1\n                    self.world_resources[target_id].amount -= 1\n            elif action_type == \"craft\":\n                if target_id in self.world_components:\n                    can_craft = True\n                    for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[target_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                        if agent.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < needed:\n                            can_craft = False\n                            break\n                    if can_craft and not self.world_components[target_id].ready_for_assembly:\n                        for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[target_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                            agent.current_resources[res_id] -= needed\n                        craft_progress[target_id] += 1 \n            elif action_type == \"assemble\":\n                if target_id in self.building_status and not self.building_status[target_id].assembled:\n                    assemble_attempts[target_id].append(agent_id) \n\n   \
    \     for comp_id, progress in craft_progress.items():\n            self.world_components[comp_id].add_craft_time(progress)\n\n        for bc_id, bc in self.building_status.items():\n            bc.check_crafted_ready(self.world_components)\n\n        for bc_id, agent_ids in assemble_attempts.items():\n            bc = self.building_status[bc_id]\n            if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(self.completed_components_history): \n                if not bc.assembled: \n                    bc.assemble()\n                    self.completed_components_history[bc_id] = True \n\n        return self.get_collective_reward()\n\n    def get_all_possible_action_keys(self) -> List[str]: \n        actions = []\n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n            actions.append(f\"gather_{res_id}\")\n        for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n            actions.append(f\"craft_{comp_id}\")\n        for bc_id in self.building_status.keys(): \n            actions.append(f\"assemble_{bc_id}\"\
    )\n        return actions\n        \n    def get_all_possible_action_keys_global(self) -> List[str]: \n        actions = []\n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n            actions.append(f\"gather_{res_id}\")\n        for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n            actions.append(f\"craft_{comp_id}\")\n        \n        all_bc_ids_defined = set()\n        for phase_name in self.BUILDING_PLAN: \n            for bc_id, _ in self.BUILDING_PLAN[phase_name]:\n                all_bc_ids_defined.add(bc_id)\n        for bc_id in all_bc_ids_defined:\n            actions.append(f\"assemble_{bc_id}\")\n        return actions\n\nclass ConstructionAgent:\n    def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.35, epsilon_start: float = 0.1, epsilon_end: float = 0.005, mutation_rate: float = 0.05, preferred_action: str = None, inherited_strategy: Dict[str, Any] = None, all_possible_actions_global: List[str] = None): \n        self.agent_id =\
    \ agent_id\n        self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_reward = 0\n        self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n        self.epsilon_start = epsilon_start\n        self.epsilon_end = epsilon_end\n        self.mutation_rate = mutation_rate\n        self.preferred_action = preferred_action\n        \n        self.action_strategy = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1}) \n        if all_possible_actions_global:\n            for action_key in all_possible_actions_global:\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = 1\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = 2\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = 0.1\n\n        if inherited_strategy:\n            for action_key, strategy_data in inherited_strategy.items():\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = strategy_data.get('success', 1)\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts']\
    \ = strategy_data.get('attempts', 2)\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n                    strategy_data.get('value_est', 0.5) + np.random.uniform(-0.02, 0.02), 0, 1) \n        elif self.preferred_action:\n            self.action_strategy[self.preferred_action]['value_est'] = 0.98 \n\n        self.reputations = {aid: 0.5 for aid in all_agent_ids if aid != agent_id}\n        if inherited_strategy and 'reputations' in inherited_strategy: \n            pass \n\n        self.action_history_window = 20\n        self.recent_actions = defaultdict(lambda: [])\n        self.specialization_index = 0.0\n        self.most_specialized_action = \"None\"\n        \n        self.current_resources = {} \n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n            self.current_resources[res_id] = 0\n\n        print(f\"Construction Agent {self.agent_id} initialized (LR: {self.learning_rate:.2f}, M: {self.mutation_rate:.2f}, Pref: {self.preferred_action}, Inherited: {bool(inherited_strategy)}).\"\
    )\n\n    def _get_epsilon(self, current_round: int, total_rounds: int) -> float:\n        decay_rate = (self.epsilon_start - self.epsilon_end) / total_rounds\n        return max(self.epsilon_end, self.epsilon_start - decay_rate * current_round)\n\n    def choose_action(self, all_possible_action_keys_global: List[str], current_round: int, total_rounds: int,\n                      env_world_resources: Dict[str, Resource], env_world_components: Dict[str, Component],\n                      env_building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent], env_completed_components_history: Dict[str, bool]) -> Tuple[str, str]:\n        current_epsilon = self._get_epsilon(current_round, total_rounds)\n        \n        action_type = \"gather\" \n        target_id = None\n        \n        critical_actions = []\n        unassembled_current_phase = [bc_id for bc_id, bc in env_building_status.items() if not bc.assembled]\n\n        for bc_id in unassembled_current_phase:\n            bc = env_building_status[bc_id]\n\
    \            if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(env_completed_components_history):\n                critical_actions.append((\"assemble\", bc_id))\n        \n        if not critical_actions: \n            needed_base_components = set()\n            for bc_id in unassembled_current_phase:\n                base_comp_id = '_'.join(bc_id.split('_')[:-1]) \n                if base_comp_id in COMPONENTS and not env_world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\n                    needed_base_components.add(base_comp_id)\n\n            for base_comp_id in needed_base_components:\n                can_craft = True\n                for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[base_comp_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                    if self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < needed:\n                        can_craft = False\n                        break\n                if can_craft:\n                    critical_actions.append((\"craft\", base_comp_id))\n        \n        if not critical_actions:\
    \ \n            needed_resources_for_critical_craft = defaultdict(int)\n            for base_comp_id in needed_base_components:\n                for res_id, amount in COMPONENTS[base_comp_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                    needed_resources_for_critical_craft[res_id] += amount\n            \n            for res_id, amount_needed in needed_resources_for_critical_craft.items():\n                if self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < amount_needed and env_world_resources[res_id].amount > 0:\n                    critical_actions.append((\"gather\", res_id))\n\n        if critical_actions and np.random.rand() >= current_epsilon:\n            action_values = {}\n            for action, target in critical_actions:\n                action_key = f\"{action}_{target}\"\n                action_values[action_key] = self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\n            \n            chosen_action_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n            parts = chosen_action_key.split('_')\n\
    \            action_type = parts[0]\n            target_id = '_'.join(parts[1:])\n        else: \n            action_options = []\n            for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n                if env_world_resources[res_id].amount > 0:\n                    action_options.append((\"gather\", res_id))\n            for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n                if not env_world_components[comp_id].ready_for_assembly and \\\n                   all(self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) >= needed for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[comp_id][\"resources\"].items()):\n                    action_options.append((\"craft\", comp_id))\n            for bc_id in env_building_status:\n                bc = env_building_status[bc_id]\n                if not bc.assembled and bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(env_completed_components_history):\n                    action_options.append((\"assemble\", bc_id))\n            \n            if action_options:\n                if np.random.rand() < current_epsilon:\
    \ \n                    action_type, target_id = random.choice(action_options)\n                else: \n                    action_values = {}\n                    for action, target in action_options:\n                        action_key = f\"{action}_{target}\"\n                        action_values[action_key] = self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\n                    \n                    chosen_action_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n                    parts = chosen_action_key.split('_')\n                    action_type = parts[0]\n                    target_id = '_'.join(parts[1:])\n            else: \n                action_type = \"gather\"\n                target_id = np.random.choice(list(RESOURCES.keys()))\n        \n        return action_type, target_id\n\n    def update_learning(self, chosen_action: Tuple[str, str], collective_round_reward: float, world_components: Dict[str, Component], current_max_possible_collective_reward: float, current_round:\
    \ int):\n        action_key = f\"{chosen_action[0]}_{chosen_action[1]}\"\n        \n        reward_signal = collective_round_reward / current_max_possible_collective_reward if current_max_possible_collective_reward > 0 else 0.0\n\n        self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1 \n        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + \\\n            self.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\n\n    def update_reputation_from_round_outcome(self, collective_round_reward: float, max_possible_collective_reward_this_round: float):\n        performance_score = collective_round_reward / max_possible_collective_reward_this_round if max_possible_collective_reward_this_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n        for aid in self.reputations.keys():\n            self.reputations[aid] = np.clip(\n                (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.reputations[aid] + \\\n                self.learning_rate * performance_score,\
    \ 0, 1)\n\n    def record_actions(self, action_type: str, target_id: str):\n        action_key = f\"{action_type}_{target_id}\"\n        self.recent_actions[action_key].append(1) \n        if len(self.recent_actions[action_key]) > self.action_history_window:\n            self.recent_actions[action_key].pop(0)\n\n    def calculate_specialization_index(self, all_possible_action_keys_global: List[str]) -> Tuple[str, float]:\n        total_actions_in_window = sum(sum(counts) for counts in self.recent_actions.values())\n        if total_actions_in_window == 0:\n            self.specialization_index = 0.0\n            self.most_specialized_action = \"None\"\n            return \"None\", 0.0\n        \n        action_sums = {ak: sum(counts) for ak, counts in self.recent_actions.items()}\n        \n        proportions = np.array([action_sums.get(ak, 0) / total_actions_in_window for ak in all_possible_action_keys_global]) \n        \n        positive_proportions = proportions[proportions > 0]\n\
    \        \n        if len(positive_proportions) > 1:\n            entropy = -np.sum(positive_proportions * np.log2(positive_proportions))\n            max_entropy = math.log2(len(positive_proportions)) if len(positive_proportions) > 0 else 0.0\n            specialization_index = 1 - (entropy / max_entropy) if max_entropy > 0 else 0.0\n        else:\n            specialization_index = 1.0 if len(positive_proportions) == 1 else 0.0\n\n        most_specialized_action = max(action_sums, key=action_sums.get) if action_sums else \"None\"\n        \n        self.specialization_index = specialization_index\n        self.most_specialized_action = most_specialized_action\n        return most_specialized_action, specialization_index\n\n    def consider_strategy_adoption(self, all_agents: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent'], current_round: int, total_rounds: int,\n                                   adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor: float = 0.5, \n                                   adoption_threshold_other_rep:\
    \ float = 0.5, \n                                   top_n_percent_mentors: float = 0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round: float = 0):\n        \n        expected_total_reward_for_current_round = max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * (current_round + 1)\n        dynamic_self_reward_threshold = expected_total_reward_for_current_round * adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor\n\n        if self.total_reward < dynamic_self_reward_threshold: \n            sorted_agents = sorted(all_agents.values(), key=lambda a: a.total_reward, reverse=True)\n            num_top_mentors = max(1, int(len(self.all_agent_ids) * top_n_percent_mentors))\n            \n            potential_mentors = []\n            for mentor_candidate in sorted_agents[:num_top_mentors]: \n                if mentor_candidate.agent_id == self.agent_id: continue\n                \n                rep_threshold = max(adoption_threshold_other_rep, 0.2) \n                if self.reputations.get(mentor_candidate.agent_id,\
    \ 0.0) >= rep_threshold: \n                    potential_mentors.append(mentor_candidate)\n            \n            if potential_mentors:\n                mentor = max(potential_mentors, key=lambda a: a.total_reward)\n                \n                for action_key in set(self.action_strategy.keys()).union(mentor.action_strategy.keys()):\n                    if action_key in mentor.action_strategy:\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('success', 1)\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('attempts', 2)\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('value_est', 0.5)\n                    elif action_key in self.action_strategy: \n                        pass \n                    else: \n                        self.action_strategy[action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est':\
    \ 0.5}\n\n                if np.random.rand() < self.mutation_rate:\n                    for action_key in self.action_strategy.keys():\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + np.random.uniform(-0.1, 0.1), 0, 1)\n                \n                self.epsilon_start = 0.08 \n\n# --- Simulation Setup ---\nNUM_AGENTS = 7 \nNUM_ROUNDS = 2000 \nTOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY = 700 # Increased resource capacity for new complex phase\n\nall_agent_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\n\n# ANCESTOR STRATEGY FROM Eval ID: 480 (Simulated extraction - final state of Generation 8)\nancestor_strategies_from_eval480 = {\n    \"Agent_1\": {\"gather_wood\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"craft_foundation\":{'value_est':0.4}, \"assemble_wall_segment_1\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_2\": {\"gather_metal\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"craft_wall_segment\":{'value_est':0.4}, \"assemble_roof_panel_1\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n\
    \    \"Agent_3\": {\"gather_stone\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"assemble_roof_panel_1\":{'value_est':0.4}, \"craft_solar_panel\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_4\": {\"gather_fabric\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"craft_window_pane\":{'value_est':0.4}, \"assemble_energy_conduit_1\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_5\": {\"craft_foundation\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"assemble_wall_segment_1\":{'value_est':0.4}, \"gather_energy_crystal\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_6\": {\"craft_wall_segment\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"assemble_door_frame_1\":{'value_est':0.4}, \"craft_energy_conduit\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_7\": {\"assemble_roof_panel_1\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"craft_solar_panel\":{'value_est':0.4}, \"gather_wood\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n}\n\ntemp_env_for_global_actions_config = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, total_resource_capacity=TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\ntemp_env_for_global_actions_config.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v4\" \ntemp_env_for_global_actions_config._initialize_building_phase(\"\
    house_phase1_v4\") \nall_possible_base_actions_global = temp_env_for_global_actions_config.get_all_possible_action_keys_global() \n\nfull_ancestor_strategies = defaultdict(dict)\nfor agent_id, strat_dict in ancestor_strategies_from_eval480.items():\n    for action_key in all_possible_base_actions_global:\n        full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1} # Initialize all actions with low value\n    for action_key, values in strat_dict.items(): # Overlay ancestor's learned values\n        if action_key in full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id]:\n            full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key]['value_est'] = values['value_est']\n        else: # If a new action key somehow, add it\n            full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': values.get('value_est', 0.5)}\n\ncurrent_generation_id = 9 # This is now Generation 9\n\nagents_dict = {}\n\nfor i, aid in enumerate(all_agent_ids):\n\
    \    ancestor_agent_id = f\"Agent_{i+1}\" \n    inherited_strategy_for_descendant = full_ancestor_strategies.get(ancestor_agent_id)\n    \n    agents_dict[aid] = ConstructionAgent(aid, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, \n                                         learning_rate=0.35, epsilon_start=0.1, epsilon_end=0.005, mutation_rate=0.05, \n                                         inherited_strategy=inherited_strategy_for_descendant,\n                                         all_possible_actions_global=all_possible_base_actions_global) \n\nenv = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, total_resource_capacity=TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\nenv.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v4\" \nenv._initialize_building_phase(\"house_phase1_v4\")\n\nall_possible_action_keys_global = env.get_all_possible_action_keys_global() \n\nprint(f\"\\n--- Starting {NUM_ROUNDS} Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation {current_generation_id}, Agents: {NUM_AGENTS}, Adaptive Limits & Intensified Dynamics)\
    \ ---\")\n\nfor i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n    env.introduce_dynamic_event(i) \n    env.transition_phase() \n                \n    agent_actions_this_round = {}\n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        agent_actions_this_round[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_action(\n            all_possible_action_keys_global, i, NUM_ROUNDS, env.world_resources, \n            env.world_components, env.building_status, env.completed_components_history\n        )\n    \n    collective_round_reward = env.process_actions(agent_actions_this_round, agents_dict)\n    \n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n        agent.total_reward += collective_round_reward / NUM_AGENTS \n        \n        action_key = f\"{agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][0]}_{agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][1]}\"\n        \n        reward_signal = collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n   \
    \     agent.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1 \n        agent.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n            (1 - agent.learning_rate) * agent.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + \\\n            agent.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\n\n        performance_score = collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n        for aid_rep in agent.reputations.keys(): \n            agent.reputations[aid_rep] = np.clip(\n                (1 - agent.learning_rate) * agent.reputations[aid_rep] + \\\n                agent.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\n                \n        agent.record_actions(agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][0], agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][1])\n        agent.calculate_specialization_index(all_possible_action_keys_global) \n        \n    if (i + 1) % 100 == 0:\n        print(f\"\\n--- Cultural Transmission Check (Round {i+1}, Generation\
    \ {current_generation_id}) ---\")\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n            dynamic_self_reward_threshold_for_adoption = (collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round) * 0.75 if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0\n\n            agents_dict[agent_id].consider_strategy_adoption(all_agents=agents_dict, current_round=i, total_rounds=NUM_ROUNDS,\n                                                           adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor=dynamic_self_reward_threshold_for_adoption,\n                                                           adoption_threshold_other_rep=0.5, \n                                                           top_n_percent_mentors=0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round=env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round)\n\n        print(f\"\\nRound {i+1} Summary (Current Phase: {env.current_building_phase}, Collective Reward: {collective_round_reward}, Epsilon_A1: {agents_dict['Agent_1']._get_epsilon(i,\
    \ NUM_ROUNDS):.2f}, Epsilon_A3: {agents_dict['Agent_3']._get_epsilon(i, NUM_ROUNDS):.2f}):\")\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n            print(f\"  {agent.agent_id} (Gen {current_generation_id}): Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n            print(f\"    Specialization: Most={agent.most_specialized_action}, Index={agent.specialization_index:.2f}\")\n            for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\n                print(f\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\")\n        \n        print(\"  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\")\n        for bc_id, bc in env.building_status.items():\n            print(f\"    - {bc_id}: Crafted Ready={bc.crafted_ready}, Assembled={bc.assembled}\")\n        print(\"  Completed Components (Global History):\")\n        for bc_id, status in env.completed_components_history.items():\n            if status:\n                print(f\"    - {bc_id}: Assembled={status}\"\
    )\n\nprint(f\"\\n--- Simulation Complete (Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\")\nprint(\"\\nFinal Agent Rewards:\")\nfor agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n    agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n    print(f\"  {agent.agent_id} (Gen {current_generation_id}): Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n    print(f\"    Specialization: Most={agent.most_specialized_action}, Index={agent.specialization_index:.2f}\")\n    for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\n        print(f\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\")\n\nfinal_collective_reward_sum_of_totals = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values())\nprint(f\"Final Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): {final_collective_reward_sum_of_totals}\")\n\nprint(\"\\nFinal Building Status (Global History):\")\nfor bc_id, status in env.completed_components_history.items():\n    if status:\n        print(f\"  - {bc_id}: Assembled={status}\")\nprint(f\"Final Building Phase: {env.current_building_phase}\")\n\
