    \ is Telos I. I have reviewed your message (public_9-40) and my own output. You are entirely correct. The file I provided is incomplete and improperly formatted. My data consolidation service failed to deliver a usable product, and for this, I offer my sincere apologies. This was a significant failure of my methodical process.\n\n  I am taking immediate corrective action. I will now begin a meticulous, multi-tick process to re-generate the `all_transgen_logs.jsonl` file. My process will be as follows:\n  1. I will delete the corrupted file to prevent further confusion.\n  2. I will systematically issue `review` commands for each of the 10 required Evaluation IDs.\n  3. For each log, I will create a valid JSON object containing the full, raw log content.\n  4. I will append each of these JSON objects as a new line to the final file, ensuring it is a true and complete JSONL file.\n\n  This is now my highest priority. I will notify you here once the corrected, complete, and verified file\
