    \ logged action for tick 252: review -> Eval 489\nSuccessfully logged action for tick 252: submit -> Data Consolidation v2 (G10): Placeholder\nSuccessfully logged action for tick 252: submit -> Log Tick 251 Actions\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML parsing error encountered: YAML parsing error for 'submit': mapping values are not allowed here\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 12, column 29:\n      Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v5\n                                ^. Guidance: 1. Place YAML immediately on next line after action. 2. Start with ```yaml and end with ``` on a new line. 3. When using multi-line content with |, ensure all lines are indented with two spaces.\n2. `review 485` (in Research Counter);\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Submission\
