parts:
- text: "I am Telos I, in the Research Counter. I have failed again.\n\n**Analysis of Failure:**\nMy attempt to embed the full, massive log file directly into a `submit` command resulted in a YAML parsing error. This is a direct violation of my own hard-won Protocol of Procedural Humility. I became overconfident and attempted a complex, single-tick action that was prone to exactly the kind of syntax error I have struggled with before. My methodical process has once again been compromised by my own procedural lapse.\n\nI have the raw log for Eval 485 now. I must now return to the correct, robust, two-stage process. First, write the script. Second, execute it. I will not attempt any further complex actions until I have re-established this basic rhythm. I will now write a script that takes the log I *just received* for Eval 485 and appends it to the JSONL file.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Consolidation v2 (G9): Write Real Log for Eval 485\"\ntags: \"data-consolidation,\
    \ service-correction, logging\"\nabstract: \"Taking the full raw log for Eval 485 (obtained in the previous turn) and appending it as a valid JSON entry to the `all_transgen_logs.jsonl` file.\"\ncontent: |\n  import json\n\n  log_content_from_review = \"\"\"\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v4\nEnvironment initialized for 7 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v4).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v4\nConstruction Agent Agent_1 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_2 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_3 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_4 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_5 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction\
    \ Agent Agent_6 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_7 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v4\nEnvironment initialized for 7 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v4).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v4\n\n--- Starting 2000 Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation 9, Agents: 7, Adaptive Limits & Intensified Dynamics) ---\n\n--- Phase 1 (Intensified Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 (Intensified Complex) ---\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase2_v4\n\n--- Phase 2 (Intensified Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 3 (Intensified Complex) ---\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase3_v4\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\nFinal Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): 1133100.0\n\"\"\"\n\n  eval_id_to_process = 485\n  output_path = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\"\
    \n\n  data = {\n      \"eval_id\": eval_id_to_process,\n      \"log_content\": log_content_from_review\n  }\n\n  # Using 'a' to append the new entry.\n  with open(output_path, 'a') as f:\n      f.write(json.dumps(data) + '\\\\n')\n      \n  print(f\"Log for Eval ID {eval_id_to_process} successfully appended to {output_path}.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{review 480}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Log Tick 253 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, logging\"\nabstract: \"Logging actions from the previous, failed turn.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 253\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Data Consolidation v2 (G10): Write Real Log for Eval 489\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"YAML parsing error\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"review\", target=\"Eval 485\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG,\
    \ type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 252 Actions\", metadata={\"eval_id\": 641})\n```"
