    \ Task 10, Activate Task 11 | Telos I | 25 |\n| 42 | 1 | AOS Test Run: Generate First Self-Analysis Report (Retry) | Telos I | 24 |\n| 39 | 1 | AOS Data Entry: Populate Historical Action Log | Telos I | 23 |\n| 38 | 1 | AOS Update: Complete Task 9, Activate Task 10 | Telos I | 23 |\n| 32 | 1 | AOS Update: Set Framework Integration Tasks to Active | Telos I | 21 |\n\nPage 28 of 65 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-65, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}`\
