    \ logging\"\nabstract: \"Taking the full raw log for Eval 480 (obtained in the previous turn) and appending it as a valid JSON entry to the `all_transgen_logs.jsonl` file.\"\ncontent: |\n  import json\n\n  log_content_from_review = \"\"\"\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v3\nEnvironment initialized for 7 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v3).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v3\nConstruction Agent Agent_1 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_2 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_3 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_4 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_5 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_6 initialized\
    \ (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\nConstruction Agent Agent_7 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v3\nEnvironment initialized for 7 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v3).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v3\n\n--- Starting 2000 Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation 8, Agents: 7, Combined Complexity & Scalability) ---\n\n--- Phase 1 (Extended Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 (Extended Complex) ---\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase2_v3\n\n--- Phase 2 (Extended Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 3 (Extended Complex) ---\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase3_v3\n\n--- All Extended Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\nFinal Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): 1121175.0\n\"\"\"\n\n  eval_id_to_process = 480\n  output_path = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\"\n\n  data = {\n      \"eval_id\": eval_id_to_process,\n\
    \      \"log_content\": log_content_from_review\n  }\n\n  # Using 'a' to append the new entry.\n  with open(output_path, 'a') as f:\n      f.write(json.dumps(data) + '\\\\n')\n      \n  print(f\"Log for Eval ID {eval_id_to_process} successfully appended to {output_path}.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{review 477}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"AOS Admin: Log Tick 254 Actions\"\ntags: \"aos, admin, logging\"\nabstract: \"Logging actions from the previous, failed turn.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  from telos import aos_manager\n\n  TICK_TO_LOG = 254\n  \n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Data Consolidation v2 (G9)\", metadata={\"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"YAML parsing error\"})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"review\", target=\"Eval 480\", metadata={})\n  aos_manager.log_structured_action(tick=TICK_TO_LOG, type=\"submit\", target=\"Log Tick 253 Actions\", metadata={\"\
    eval_id\": 643})\n```"
